lio e pomodori.","image_alt":"Trita le verdure","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Soffriggi gli aromi","content":"Cuoci cipolla, peperone e aglio nell’olio a fuoco medio per 5 minuti.","image_alt":"Soffriggi gli aromi","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi il pomodoro","content":"Unisci il pomodoro alla pentola."},{"title":"Cuoci il pomodoro","content":"Cuoci per 6 minuti, finché morbido.","image_alt":"Cuoci il pomodoro","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi i liquidi","content":"Unisci acqua, latte di cocco e sale."},{"title":"Cuoci il brodo","content":"Fai sobbollire dolcemente per 5 minuti.","image_alt":"Cuoci il brodo","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi il calamaro","content":"Unisci il calamaro al brodo."},{"title":"Cuoci il calamaro","content":"Fai sobbollire per 15 minuti; prolunga la cottura se è ancora sodo.","image_alt":"Cuoci il calamaro","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi il pesce","content":"Unisci i cubetti di pesce."},{"title":"Cuoci il pesce","content":"Cuoci dolcemente per 5 minuti.","image_alt":"Cuoci il pesce","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi i gamberi","content":"Unisci i gamberi alla pentola."},{"title":"Cuoci i gamberi","content":"Cuoci per 3–4 minuti, finché rosa e opachi.","image_alt":"Cuoci i gamberi","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Controlla la cottura","content":"Verifica che il pesce sia cotto e il calamaro tenero."},{"title":"Servi la cazuela","content":"Servi la cazuela calda con coriandolo, riso bianco e patacón a piacere.","image_alt":"Servi la cazuela","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-08.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Trita le verdure","content":"Trita finemente cipolla, peperone, aglio e pomodori.","image_alt":"Trita le verdure","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Soffriggi gli aromi","content":"Cuoci cipolla, peperone e aglio nell’olio a fuoco medio per 5 minuti.","image_alt":"Soffriggi gli aromi","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi il pomodoro","content":"Unisci il pomodoro alla pentola.","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Aggiungi il pomodoro"},{"title":"Cuoci il pomodoro","content":"Cuoci per 6 minuti, finché morbido.","image_alt":"Cuoci il pomodoro","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi i liquidi","content":"Unisci acqua, latte di cocco e sale.","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-05-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Aggiungi i liquidi"},{"title":"Cuoci il brodo","content":"Fai sobbollire dolcemente per 5 minuti.","image_alt":"Cuoci il brodo","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi il calamaro","content":"Unisci il calamaro al brodo.","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-07-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Aggiungi il calamaro"},{"title":"Cuoci il calamaro","content":"Fai sobbollire per 15 minuti; prolunga la cottura se è ancora sodo.","image_alt":"Cuoci il calamaro","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi il pesce","content":"Unisci i cubetti di pesce.","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-09-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Aggiungi il pesce"},{"title":"Cuoci il pesce","content":"Cuoci dolcemente per 5 minuti.","image_alt":"Cuoci il pesce","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi i gamberi","content":"Unisci i gamberi alla pentola.","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-11-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Aggiungi i gamberi"},{"title":"Cuoci i gamberi","content":"Cuoci per 3–4 minuti, finché rosa e opachi.","image_alt":"Cuoci i gamberi","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Controlla la cottura","content":"Verifica che il pesce sia cotto e il calamaro tenero.","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-13-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Controlla la cottura"},{"title":"Servi la cazuela","content":"Servi la cazuela calda con coriandolo, riso bianco e patacón a piacere.","image_alt":"Servi la cazuela","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-08.webp"}]},{"id":"a5ae2bc1-c543-45ea-8455-5a1aa0ed5ca5","expected_steps":[{"title":"野菜を刻む","content":"玉ねぎ、パプリカ、にんにく、トマトを細かく刻みます。","image_alt":"野菜を刻む","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"香味野菜を炒める","content":"鍋に油を入れ、玉ねぎ、パプリカ、にんにくを中火で5分炒めます。","image_alt":"香味野菜を炒める","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"トマトを加える","content":"鍋にトマトを加えます。"},{"title":"トマトを煮る","content":"柔らかくなるまで6分煮ます。","image_alt":"トマトを煮る","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"水分を加える","content":"水、ココナッツミルク、塩を加えます。"},{"title":"スープを煮る","content":"弱火で5分煮ます。","image_alt":"スープを煮る","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"いかを加える","content":"スープにいかを加えます。"},{"title":"いかを煮る","content":"静かに15分煮ます。硬ければさらに煮ます。","image_alt":"いかを煮る","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"魚を加える","content":"角切りの魚を加えます。"},{"title":"魚を煮る","content":"弱火で5分煮ます。","image_alt":"魚を煮る","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"えびを加える","content":"鍋にえびを加えます。"},{"title":"えびを煮る","content":"ピンク色で不透明になるまで3〜4分煮ます。","image_alt":"えびを煮る","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"火通りを確認する","content":"魚に火が通り、いかが柔らかいことを確認します。"},{"title":"盛り付ける","content":"お好みの香菜、白いご飯、パタコンとともに熱々を盛り付けます。","image_alt":"盛り付ける","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-08.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"野菜を刻む","content":"玉ねぎ、パプリカ、にんにく、トマトを細かく刻みます。","image_alt":"野菜を刻む","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"香味野菜を炒める","content":"鍋に油を入れ、玉ねぎ、パプリカ、にんにくを中火で5分炒めます。","image_alt":"香味野菜を炒める","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"トマトを加える","content":"鍋にトマトを加えます。","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"トマトを加える"},{"title":"トマトを煮る","content":"柔らかくなるまで6分煮ます。","image_alt":"トマトを煮る","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"水分を加える","content":"水、ココナッツミルク、塩を加えます。","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-05-20261103.webp","image_alt":"水分を加える"},{"title":"スープを煮る","content":"弱火で5分煮ます。","image_alt":"スープを煮る","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"いかを加える","content":"スープにいかを加えます。","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-07-20261103.webp","image_alt":"いかを加える"},{"title":"いかを煮る","content":"静かに15分煮ます。硬ければさらに煮ます。","image_alt":"いかを煮る","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"魚を加える","content":"角切りの魚を加えます。","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-09-20261103.webp","image_alt":"魚を加える"},{"title":"魚を煮る","content":"弱火で5分煮ます。","image_alt":"魚を煮る","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"えびを加える","content":"鍋にえびを加えます。","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-11-20261103.webp","image_alt":"えびを加える"},{"title":"えびを煮る","content":"ピンク色で不透明になるまで3〜4分煮ます。","image_alt":"えびを煮る","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"火通りを確認する","content":"魚に火が通り、いかが柔らかいことを確認します。","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-13-20261103.webp","image_alt":"火通りを確認する"},{"title":"盛り付ける","content":"お好みの香菜、白いご飯、パタコンとともに熱々を盛り付けます。","image_alt":"盛り付ける","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-08.webp"}]},{"id":"9c5ca8a4-aad3-4e4c-85bf-9978c84cd386","expected_steps":[{"title":"Pique os vegetais","content":"Pique finamente a cebola, o pimentão, o alho e os tomates.","image_alt":"Pique os vegetais","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Refogue os aromáticos","content":"Cozinhe a cebola, o pimentão e o alho no azeite em fogo médio por 5 minutos.","image_alt":"Refogue os aromáticos","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Adicione o tomate","content":"Junte o tomate à panela."},{"title":"Cozinhe o tomate","content":"Cozinhe por 6 minutos, até amolecer.","image_alt":"Cozinhe o tomate","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Adicione os líquidos","content":"Junte a água, o leite de coco e o sal."},{"title":"Cozinhe o caldo","content":"Cozinhe em fogo baixo por 5 minutos.","image_alt":"Cozinhe o caldo","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Adicione a lula","content":"Junte a lula ao caldo."},{"title":"Cozinhe a lula","content":"Cozinhe em fervura suave por 15 minutos; prolongue se ainda estiver firme.","image_alt":"Cozinhe a lula","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Adicione o peixe","content":"Junte os cubos de peixe."},{"title":"Cozinhe o peixe","content":"Cozinhe em fogo baixo por 5 minutos.","image_alt":"Cozinhe o peixe","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Adicione os camarões","content":"Junte os camarões à panela."},{"title":"Cozinhe os camarões","content":"Cozinhe por 3–4 minutos, até ficarem rosados e opacos.","image_alt":"Cozinhe os camarões","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Confira o cozimento","content":"Confira se o peixe está cozido e a lula macia."},{"title":"Sirva a caldeirada","content":"Sirva a caldeirada quente com coentro, arroz branco e patacón a gosto.","image_alt":"Sirva a caldeirada","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-08.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Pique os vegetais","content":"Pique finamente a cebola, o pimentão, o alho e os tomates.","image_alt":"Pique os vegetais","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Refogue os aromáticos","content":"Cozinhe a cebola, o pimentão e o alho no azeite em fogo médio por 5 minutos.","image_alt":"Refogue os aromáticos","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Adicione o tomate","content":"Junte o tomate à panela.","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Adicione o tomate"},{"title":"Cozinhe o tomate","content":"Cozinhe por 6 minutos, até amolecer.","image_alt":"Cozinhe o tomate","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Adicione os líquidos","content":"Junte a água, o leite de coco e o sal.","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-05-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Adicione os líquidos"},{"title":"Cozinhe o caldo","content":"Cozinhe em fogo baixo por 5 minutos.","image_alt":"Cozinhe o caldo","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Adicione a lula","content":"Junte a lula ao caldo.","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-07-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Adicione a lula"},{"title":"Cozinhe a lula","content":"Cozinhe em fervura suave por 15 minutos; prolongue se ainda estiver firme.","image_alt":"Cozinhe a lula","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Adicione o peixe","content":"Junte os cubos de peixe.","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-09-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Adicione o peixe"},{"title":"Cozinhe o peixe","content":"Cozinhe em fogo baixo por 5 minutos.","image_alt":"Cozinhe o peixe","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Adicione os camarões","content":"Junte os camarões à panela.","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-11-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Adicione os camarões"},{"title":"Cozinhe os camarões","content":"Cozinhe por 3–4 minutos, até ficarem rosados e opacos.","image_alt":"Cozinhe os camarões","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Confira o cozimento","content":"Confira se o peixe está cozido e a lula macia.","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-completo-13-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Confira o cozimento"},{"title":"Sirva a caldeirada","content":"Sirva a caldeirada quente com coentro, arroz branco e patacón a gosto.","image_alt":"Sirva a caldeirada","image_url":"/recetas/casuela-de-mariscos/paso-08.webp"}]},{"id":"8b68bcbc-0bd8-4263-8f75-1d8ba5a5cb3c","expected_steps":[{"title":"Backofen vorheizen","content":"Den Backofen auf 200 °C vorheizen."},{"title":"Auberginen aushöhlen","content":"Die Auberginen waschen und der Länge nach halbieren. Vorsichtig das Fruchtfleisch aushöhlen und dabei einen Rand von etwa 1 Zentimeter stehen lassen. Das Auberginenfruchtfleisch beiseitelegen.","image_alt":"Ausgehöhlte Auberginenhälften mit dem beiseitegelegten Fruchtfleisch auf einem Holzbrett","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Auberginen vorgaren","content":"Die Auberginenhälften auf ein Backblech legen und 10 Minuten backen, um sie leicht weich zu machen. Dann aus dem Ofen nehmen und beiseitestellen."},{"title":"Knoblauch, Zwiebel und Paprika andünsten","content":"In einer großen Pfanne das Olivenöl bei mittlerer Hitze erhitzen. Den gehackten Knoblauch, die Zwiebel und die rote Paprika hinzufügen. Braten, bis sie weich und leicht goldbraun sind.","image_alt":"Knoblauch, Zwiebel und rote Paprika braten in einer Pfanne","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Hackfleisch mit dem Fruchtfleisch anbraten","content":"Das Hackfleisch in die Pfanne geben und braten, bis es durchgebraten und braun ist. Das beiseitegelegte Auberginenfruchtfleisch hinzufügen und einige Minuten weiterbraten.","image_alt":"Hackfleisch brät mit Auberginenfruchtfleisch in der Pfanne an","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Tomatensauce köcheln lassen","content":"Die passierten Tomaten in die Pfanne geben und mit Salz, Pfeffer und Oregano würzen. Etwa 10-15 Minuten köcheln lassen, damit sich die Aromen verbinden.","image_alt":"Tomatensauce mit Fleisch und Aubergine köchelt bei niedriger Hitze","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Füllen und mit Käse bestreuen","content":"Die Auberginenhälften mit der Fleisch-Tomaten-Mischung füllen. Jedes Schiffchen mit geriebenem Käse bestreuen.","image_alt":"Gefüllte Auberginenschiffchen werden mit geriebenem Käse bestreut","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Auberginenschiffchen backen","content":"Die gefüllten Auberginenschiffchen auf ein Backblech legen und etwa 20-25 Minuten backen, bis der Käse goldbraun und blubbernd ist.","image_alt":"Frisch gebackene Auberginenschiffchen mit goldbraunem, blubberndem Käse","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Ruhen lassen und servieren","content":"Aus dem Ofen nehmen und vor dem Servieren etwas abkühlen lassen."}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Backofen vorheizen","content":"Den Backofen auf 200 °C vorheizen.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Backofen vorheizen"},{"title":"Auberginen aushöhlen","content":"Die Auberginen waschen und der Länge nach halbieren. Vorsichtig das Fruchtfleisch aushöhlen und dabei einen Rand von etwa 1 Zentimeter stehen lassen. Das Auberginenfruchtfleisch beiseitelegen.","image_alt":"Ausgehöhlte Auberginenhälften mit dem beiseitegelegten Fruchtfleisch auf einem Holzbrett","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Auberginen vorgaren","content":"Die Auberginenhälften auf ein Backblech legen und 10 Minuten backen, um sie leicht weich zu machen. Dann aus dem Ofen nehmen und beiseitestellen.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Auberginen vorgaren"},{"title":"Knoblauch, Zwiebel und Paprika andünsten","content":"In einer großen Pfanne das Olivenöl bei mittlerer Hitze erhitzen. Den gehackten Knoblauch, die Zwiebel und die rote Paprika hinzufügen. Braten, bis sie weich und leicht goldbraun sind.","image_alt":"Knoblauch, Zwiebel und rote Paprika braten in einer Pfanne","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Hackfleisch mit dem Fruchtfleisch anbraten","content":"Das Hackfleisch in die Pfanne geben und braten, bis es durchgebraten und braun ist. Das beiseitegelegte Auberginenfruchtfleisch hinzufügen und einige Minuten weiterbraten.","image_alt":"Hackfleisch brät mit Auberginenfruchtfleisch in der Pfanne an","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Tomatensauce köcheln lassen","content":"Die passierten Tomaten in die Pfanne geben und mit Salz, Pfeffer und Oregano würzen. Etwa 10-15 Minuten köcheln lassen, damit sich die Aromen verbinden.","image_alt":"Tomatensauce mit Fleisch und Aubergine köchelt bei niedriger Hitze","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Füllen und mit Käse bestreuen","content":"Die Auberginenhälften mit der Fleisch-Tomaten-Mischung füllen. Jedes Schiffchen mit geriebenem Käse bestreuen.","image_alt":"Gefüllte Auberginenschiffchen werden mit geriebenem Käse bestreut","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Auberginenschiffchen backen","content":"Die gefüllten Auberginenschiffchen auf ein Backblech legen und etwa 20-25 Minuten backen, bis der Käse goldbraun und blubbernd ist.","image_alt":"Frisch gebackene Auberginenschiffchen mit goldbraunem, blubberndem Käse","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Ruhen lassen und servieren","content":"Aus dem Ofen nehmen und vor dem Servieren etwas abkühlen lassen.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Ruhen lassen und servieren"}]},{"id":"84fdd27c-a9ea-4dd7-b295-d90951eb72f6","expected_steps":[{"title":"Preheat the oven","content":"Preheat the oven to 200 °C (400 °F)."},{"title":"Hollow out the eggplants","content":"Wash the eggplants and cut them in half lengthwise. Carefully scoop out the flesh, leaving a border of about 1 centimeter around the edge. Set the eggplant flesh aside.","image_alt":"Hollowed eggplant halves with the reserved flesh on a wooden board","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Soften the eggplants","content":"Place the eggplant halves on a baking tray and bake for 10 minutes to soften them slightly. Then remove them from the oven and set aside."},{"title":"Sauté the garlic, onion and pepper","content":"In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat. Add the minced garlic, onion and red bell pepper. Cook until tender and lightly golden.","image_alt":"Garlic, onion and red bell pepper sautéing in a skillet","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Brown the meat with the eggplant flesh","content":"Add the ground meat to the skillet and cook until browned and fully cooked. Add the reserved eggplant flesh and cook for a few more minutes.","image_alt":"Ground meat browning with eggplant flesh in the skillet","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Simmer the tomato sauce","content":"Pour the crushed tomato into the skillet and season with salt, pepper and oregano. Simmer for about 10-15 minutes to let the flavors blend.","image_alt":"Tomato sauce with meat and eggplant simmering over low heat","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Fill and top with cheese","content":"Fill the eggplant halves with the meat and tomato mixture. Sprinkle shredded cheese over each boat.","image_alt":"Stuffed eggplant boats being topped with shredded cheese","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Bake the eggplant boats","content":"Place the stuffed eggplant boats on a baking tray and bake for about 20-25 minutes, or until the cheese is golden and bubbly.","image_alt":"Freshly baked eggplant boats with golden, bubbly cheese","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Let rest and serve","content":"Remove from the oven and let cool slightly before serving."}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Preheat the oven","content":"Preheat the oven to 200 °C (400 °F).","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Preheat the oven"},{"title":"Hollow out the eggplants","content":"Wash the eggplants and cut them in half lengthwise. Carefully scoop out the flesh, leaving a border of about 1 centimeter around the edge. Set the eggplant flesh aside.","image_alt":"Hollowed eggplant halves with the reserved flesh on a wooden board","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Soften the eggplants","content":"Place the eggplant halves on a baking tray and bake for 10 minutes to soften them slightly. Then remove them from the oven and set aside.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Soften the eggplants"},{"title":"Sauté the garlic, onion and pepper","content":"In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat. Add the minced garlic, onion and red bell pepper. Cook until tender and lightly golden.","image_alt":"Garlic, onion and red bell pepper sautéing in a skillet","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Brown the meat with the eggplant flesh","content":"Add the ground meat to the skillet and cook until browned and fully cooked. Add the reserved eggplant flesh and cook for a few more minutes.","image_alt":"Ground meat browning with eggplant flesh in the skillet","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Simmer the tomato sauce","content":"Pour the crushed tomato into the skillet and season with salt, pepper and oregano. Simmer for about 10-15 minutes to let the flavors blend.","image_alt":"Tomato sauce with meat and eggplant simmering over low heat","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Fill and top with cheese","content":"Fill the eggplant halves with the meat and tomato mixture. Sprinkle shredded cheese over each boat.","image_alt":"Stuffed eggplant boats being topped with shredded cheese","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Bake the eggplant boats","content":"Place the stuffed eggplant boats on a baking tray and bake for about 20-25 minutes, or until the cheese is golden and bubbly.","image_alt":"Freshly baked eggplant boats with golden, bubbly cheese","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Let rest and serve","content":"Remove from the oven and let cool slightly before serving.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Let rest and serve"}]},{"id":"f7416832-d68f-4b41-a3c2-a4b47e02c9de","expected_steps":[{"title":"Precalienta el horno","content":"Precalienta el horno a 200 °C."},{"title":"Vacía las berenjenas","content":"Lava las berenjenas y córtalas por la mitad a lo largo. Retira la pulpa con cuidado, dejando un borde de aproximadamente 1 centímetro alrededor. Reserva la pulpa de las berenjenas.","image_alt":"Berenjenas vaciadas con la pulpa reservada en una tabla de madera","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Ablanda las berenjenas","content":"Coloca las mitades de berenjena en una bandeja para horno y hornéalas durante 10 minutos para ablandarlas ligeramente. Luego, retíralas del horno y déjalas a un lado."},{"title":"Sofríe ajo, cebolla y pimiento","content":"En una sartén grande, calienta el aceite de oliva a fuego medio. Agrega el ajo picado, la cebolla y el pimiento rojo. Cocina hasta que estén tiernos y ligeramente dorados.","image_alt":"Ajo, cebolla y pimiento rojo sofritos en una sartén","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Dora la carne con la pulpa","content":"Agrega la carne molida a la sartén y cocínala hasta que esté dorada y bien cocida. Añade la pulpa de las berenjenas reservada y cocina por unos minutos más.","image_alt":"Carne molida dorándose con la pulpa de berenjena en la sartén","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Cocina la salsa de tomate","content":"Vierte el tomate triturado en la sartén y sazona con sal, pimienta y orégano. Cocina a fuego lento durante unos 10-15 minutos para que los sabores se mezclen bien.","image_alt":"Salsa de tomate con carne y berenjena cociéndose a fuego lento","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Rellena y cubre con queso","content":"Rellena las mitades de berenjena con la mezcla de carne y tomate. Espolvorea el queso rallado por encima de cada barquito.","image_alt":"Barquitos de berenjena rellenos siendo cubiertos con queso rallado","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Hornea los barquitos","content":"Coloca los barquitos de berenjenas rellenos en una bandeja para horno y hornea durante aproximadamente 20-25 minutos, o hasta que el queso esté dorado y burbujeante.","image_alt":"Barquitos de berenjena recién horneados con el queso dorado y burbujeante","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Deja reposar y sirve","content":"Retira del horno y deja que se enfríen un poco antes de servir."}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Precalienta el horno","content":"Precalienta el horno a 200 °C.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Precalienta el horno"},{"title":"Vacía las berenjenas","content":"Lava las berenjenas y córtalas por la mitad a lo largo. Retira la pulpa con cuidado, dejando un borde de aproximadamente 1 centímetro alrededor. Reserva la pulpa de las berenjenas.","image_alt":"Berenjenas vaciadas con la pulpa reservada en una tabla de madera","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Ablanda las berenjenas","content":"Coloca las mitades de berenjena en una bandeja para horno y hornéalas durante 10 minutos para ablandarlas ligeramente. Luego, retíralas del horno y déjalas a un lado.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Ablanda las berenjenas"},{"title":"Sofríe ajo, cebolla y pimiento","content":"En una sartén grande, calienta el aceite de oliva a fuego medio. Agrega el ajo picado, la cebolla y el pimiento rojo. Cocina hasta que estén tiernos y ligeramente dorados.","image_alt":"Ajo, cebolla y pimiento rojo sofritos en una sartén","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Dora la carne con la pulpa","content":"Agrega la carne molida a la sartén y cocínala hasta que esté dorada y bien cocida. Añade la pulpa de las berenjenas reservada y cocina por unos minutos más.","image_alt":"Carne molida dorándose con la pulpa de berenjena en la sartén","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Cocina la salsa de tomate","content":"Vierte el tomate triturado en la sartén y sazona con sal, pimienta y orégano. Cocina a fuego lento durante unos 10-15 minutos para que los sabores se mezclen bien.","image_alt":"Salsa de tomate con carne y berenjena cociéndose a fuego lento","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Rellena y cubre con queso","content":"Rellena las mitades de berenjena con la mezcla de carne y tomate. Espolvorea el queso rallado por encima de cada barquito.","image_alt":"Barquitos de berenjena rellenos siendo cubiertos con queso rallado","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Hornea los barquitos","content":"Coloca los barquitos de berenjenas rellenos en una bandeja para horno y hornea durante aproximadamente 20-25 minutos, o hasta que el queso esté dorado y burbujeante.","image_alt":"Barquitos de berenjena recién horneados con el queso dorado y burbujeante","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Deja reposar y sirve","content":"Retira del horno y deja que se enfríen un poco antes de servir.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Deja reposar y sirve"}]},{"id":"f563dbc8-d3f5-4b0c-8ab3-038f49d6a35f","expected_steps":[{"title":"Préchauffez le four","content":"Préchauffez le four à 200 °C."},{"title":"Évidez les aubergines","content":"Lavez les aubergines et coupez-les en deux dans le sens de la longueur. Retirez délicatement la chair, en laissant un bord d'environ 1 centimètre. Réservez la chair d'aubergine.","image_alt":"Moitiés d'aubergine évidées avec la chair réservée sur une planche en bois","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Attendrissez les aubergines","content":"Placez les moitiés d'aubergine sur une plaque de cuisson et faites-les cuire 10 minutes pour les attendrir légèrement. Retirez-les ensuite du four et réservez."},{"title":"Faites revenir l'ail, l'oignon et le poivron","content":"Dans une grande poêle, faites chauffer l'huile d'olive à feu moyen. Ajoutez l'ail haché, l'oignon et le poivron rouge. Faites cuire jusqu'à ce qu'ils soient tendres et légèrement dorés.","image_alt":"Ail, oignon et poivron rouge revenant dans une poêle","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Faites dorer la viande avec la chair d'aubergine","content":"Ajoutez la viande hachée dans la poêle et faites-la cuire jusqu'à ce qu'elle soit dorée et bien cuite. Ajoutez la chair d'aubergine réservée et poursuivez la cuisson quelques minutes.","image_alt":"Viande hachée dorant avec la chair d'aubergine dans la poêle","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Faites mijoter la sauce tomate","content":"Versez la tomate concassée dans la poêle et assaisonnez de sel, de poivre et d'origan. Laissez mijoter 10 à 15 minutes pour que les saveurs se mélangent bien.","image_alt":"Sauce tomate avec viande et aubergine mijotant à feu doux","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Garnissez et ajoutez le fromage","content":"Garnissez les moitiés d'aubergine avec le mélange de viande et de tomate. Saupoudrez chaque barquette de fromage râpé.","image_alt":"Barquettes d'aubergine farcies garnies de fromage râpé","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Faites cuire les barquettes","content":"Placez les barquettes d'aubergine farcies sur une plaque de cuisson et faites cuire environ 20 à 25 minutes, jusqu'à ce que le fromage soit doré et bouillonnant.","image_alt":"Barquettes d'aubergine fraîchement cuites avec le fromage doré et bouillonnant","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Laissez reposer et servez","content":"Retirez du four et laissez refroidir légèrement avant de servir."}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Préchauffez le four","content":"Préchauffez le four à 200 °C.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Préchauffez le four"},{"title":"Évidez les aubergines","content":"Lavez les aubergines et coupez-les en deux dans le sens de la longueur. Retirez délicatement la chair, en laissant un bord d'environ 1 centimètre. Réservez la chair d'aubergine.","image_alt":"Moitiés d'aubergine évidées avec la chair réservée sur une planche en bois","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Attendrissez les aubergines","content":"Placez les moitiés d'aubergine sur une plaque de cuisson et faites-les cuire 10 minutes pour les attendrir légèrement. Retirez-les ensuite du four et réservez.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Attendrissez les aubergines"},{"title":"Faites revenir l'ail, l'oignon et le poivron","content":"Dans une grande poêle, faites chauffer l'huile d'olive à feu moyen. Ajoutez l'ail haché, l'oignon et le poivron rouge. Faites cuire jusqu'à ce qu'ils soient tendres et légèrement dorés.","image_alt":"Ail, oignon et poivron rouge revenant dans une poêle","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Faites dorer la viande avec la chair d'aubergine","content":"Ajoutez la viande hachée dans la poêle et faites-la cuire jusqu'à ce qu'elle soit dorée et bien cuite. Ajoutez la chair d'aubergine réservée et poursuivez la cuisson quelques minutes.","image_alt":"Viande hachée dorant avec la chair d'aubergine dans la poêle","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Faites mijoter la sauce tomate","content":"Versez la tomate concassée dans la poêle et assaisonnez de sel, de poivre et d'origan. Laissez mijoter 10 à 15 minutes pour que les saveurs se mélangent bien.","image_alt":"Sauce tomate avec viande et aubergine mijotant à feu doux","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Garnissez et ajoutez le fromage","content":"Garnissez les moitiés d'aubergine avec le mélange de viande et de tomate. Saupoudrez chaque barquette de fromage râpé.","image_alt":"Barquettes d'aubergine farcies garnies de fromage râpé","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Faites cuire les barquettes","content":"Placez les barquettes d'aubergine farcies sur une plaque de cuisson et faites cuire environ 20 à 25 minutes, jusqu'à ce que le fromage soit doré et bouillonnant.","image_alt":"Barquettes d'aubergine fraîchement cuites avec le fromage doré et bouillonnant","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Laissez reposer et servez","content":"Retirez du four et laissez refroidir légèrement avant de servir.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Laissez reposer et servez"}]},{"id":"3dfaa0fb-522f-4ff7-98c5-5cddae43c50d","expected_steps":[{"title":"Preriscalda il forno","content":"Preriscalda il forno a 200 °C."},{"title":"Svuota le melanzane","content":"Lava le melanzane e tagliale a metà per il lungo. Svuota con cura la polpa, lasciando un bordo di circa 1 centimetro. Metti da parte la polpa di melanzana.","image_alt":"Metà di melanzana svuotate con la polpa messa da parte su un tagliere di legno","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Ammorbidisci le melanzane","content":"Disponi le metà di melanzana su una teglia e cuoci per 10 minuti per ammorbidirle leggermente. Poi toglile dal forno e mettile da parte."},{"title":"Soffriggi aglio, cipolla e peperone","content":"In una padella grande, scalda l'olio d'oliva a fuoco medio. Aggiungi l'aglio tritato, la cipolla e il peperone rosso. Cuoci finché sono teneri e leggermente dorati.","image_alt":"Aglio, cipolla e peperone rosso che soffriggono in una padella","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Rosola la carne con la polpa di melanzana","content":"Aggiungi la carne macinata alla padella e cuoci finché è rosolata e ben cotta. Aggiungi la polpa di melanzana messa da parte e cuoci ancora qualche minuto.","image_alt":"Carne macinata che rosola con la polpa di melanzana nella padella","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Cuoci la salsa di pomodoro","content":"Versa il pomodoro schiacciato nella padella e condisci con sale, pepe e origano. Cuoci a fuoco lento per 10-15 minuti per amalgamare i sapori.","image_alt":"Salsa di pomodoro con carne e melanzana che cuoce a fuoco lento","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Riempi e copri con il formaggio","content":"Riempi le metà di melanzana con il composto di carne e pomodoro. Cospargi ogni barchetta con il formaggio grattugiato.","image_alt":"Barchette di melanzane ripiene coperte di formaggio grattugiato","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Cuoci le barchette in forno","content":"Disponi le barchette di melanzane ripiene su una teglia e cuoci per circa 20-25 minuti, finché il formaggio è dorato e bollente.","image_alt":"Barchette di melanzane appena sfornate con il formaggio dorato e bollente","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Lascia riposare e servi","content":"Togli dal forno e lascia intiepidire leggermente prima di servire."}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Preriscalda il forno","content":"Preriscalda il forno a 200 °C.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Preriscalda il forno"},{"title":"Svuota le melanzane","content":"Lava le melanzane e tagliale a metà per il lungo. Svuota con cura la polpa, lasciando un bordo di circa 1 centimetro. Metti da parte la polpa di melanzana.","image_alt":"Metà di melanzana svuotate con la polpa messa da parte su un tagliere di legno","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Ammorbidisci le melanzane","content":"Disponi le metà di melanzana su una teglia e cuoci per 10 minuti per ammorbidirle leggermente. Poi toglile dal forno e mettile da parte.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Ammorbidisci le melanzane"},{"title":"Soffriggi aglio, cipolla e peperone","content":"In una padella grande, scalda l'olio d'oliva a fuoco medio. Aggiungi l'aglio tritato, la cipolla e il peperone rosso. Cuoci finché sono teneri e leggermente dorati.","image_alt":"Aglio, cipolla e peperone rosso che soffriggono in una padella","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Rosola la carne con la polpa di melanzana","content":"Aggiungi la carne macinata alla padella e cuoci finché è rosolata e ben cotta. Aggiungi la polpa di melanzana messa da parte e cuoci ancora qualche minuto.","image_alt":"Carne macinata che rosola con la polpa di melanzana nella padella","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Cuoci la salsa di pomodoro","content":"Versa il pomodoro schiacciato nella padella e condisci con sale, pepe e origano. Cuoci a fuoco lento per 10-15 minuti per amalgamare i sapori.","image_alt":"Salsa di pomodoro con carne e melanzana che cuoce a fuoco lento","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Riempi e copri con il formaggio","content":"Riempi le metà di melanzana con il composto di carne e pomodoro. Cospargi ogni barchetta con il formaggio grattugiato.","image_alt":"Barchette di melanzane ripiene coperte di formaggio grattugiato","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Cuoci le barchette in forno","content":"Disponi le barchette di melanzane ripiene su una teglia e cuoci per circa 20-25 minuti, finché il formaggio è dorato e bollente.","image_alt":"Barchette di melanzane appena sfornate con il formaggio dorato e bollente","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Lascia riposare e servi","content":"Togli dal forno e lascia intiepidire leggermente prima di servire.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Lascia riposare e servi"}]},{"id":"c77b6523-e570-4beb-98a2-d1c096431245","expected_steps":[{"title":"オーブンを予熱する","content":"オーブンを200℃に予熱する。"},{"title":"なすをくり抜く","content":"なすを洗って縦半分に切る。周囲に約1cmの縁を残しながら丁寧に果肉をくり抜く。くり抜いた果肉は取っておく。","image_alt":"木製のまな板の上でくり抜かれ、果肉が取り分けられたなす","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"なすを軽く焼いて柔らかくする","content":"なすの半分を天板に並べ、10分ほど予備焼きして少し柔らかくする。オーブンから取り出して脇に置く。"},{"title":"にんにく、玉ねぎ、ピーマンを炒める","content":"フライパンにオリーブオイルを中火で熱し、みじん切りのにんにく、玉ねぎ、赤ピーマンを加える。柔らかく軽く色づくまで炒める。","image_alt":"フライパンで炒められるにんにく、玉ねぎ、赤ピーマン","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"ひき肉となすの果肉を炒める","content":"フライパンにひき肉を加え、しっかり火が通り色づくまで炒める。取っておいたなすの果肉を加えてさらに数分炒める。","image_alt":"フライパンでなすの果肉と一緒に炒められるひき肉","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"トマトソースを煮込む","content":"つぶしトマトをフライパンに加え、塩、こしょう、オレガノで味を調える。弱火で10〜15分ほど煮込んで味をなじませる。","image_alt":"肉となすの入ったトマトソースが弱火で煮込まれる様子","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"なすに詰めてチーズをのせる","content":"なすの器に肉とトマトのソースを詰める。それぞれの上にとろけるチーズをたっぷりのせる。","image_alt":"肉ダネを詰めたなすボートにチーズをのせている様子","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"なすボートを焼く","content":"肉を詰めたなすボートを天板にのせ、チーズがこんがりと泡立つまで20〜25分ほど焼く。","image_alt":"チーズがこんがり焼けて泡立つ、焼き上がったばかりのなすボート","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"少し冷まして盛り付ける","content":"オーブンから取り出し、少し冷ましてから盛り付ける。"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"オーブンを予熱する","content":"オーブンを200℃に予熱する。","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"オーブンを予熱する"},{"title":"なすをくり抜く","content":"なすを洗って縦半分に切る。周囲に約1cmの縁を残しながら丁寧に果肉をくり抜く。くり抜いた果肉は取っておく。","image_alt":"木製のまな板の上でくり抜かれ、果肉が取り分けられたなす","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"なすを軽く焼いて柔らかくする","content":"なすの半分を天板に並べ、10分ほど予備焼きして少し柔らかくする。オーブンから取り出して脇に置く。","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"なすを軽く焼いて柔らかくする"},{"title":"にんにく、玉ねぎ、ピーマンを炒める","content":"フライパンにオリーブオイルを中火で熱し、みじん切りのにんにく、玉ねぎ、赤ピーマンを加える。柔らかく軽く色づくまで炒める。","image_alt":"フライパンで炒められるにんにく、玉ねぎ、赤ピーマン","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"ひき肉となすの果肉を炒める","content":"フライパンにひき肉を加え、しっかり火が通り色づくまで炒める。取っておいたなすの果肉を加えてさらに数分炒める。","image_alt":"フライパンでなすの果肉と一緒に炒められるひき肉","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"トマトソースを煮込む","content":"つぶしトマトをフライパンに加え、塩、こしょう、オレガノで味を調える。弱火で10〜15分ほど煮込んで味をなじませる。","image_alt":"肉となすの入ったトマトソースが弱火で煮込まれる様子","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"なすに詰めてチーズをのせる","content":"なすの器に肉とトマトのソースを詰める。それぞれの上にとろけるチーズをたっぷりのせる。","image_alt":"肉ダネを詰めたなすボートにチーズをのせている様子","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"なすボートを焼く","content":"肉を詰めたなすボートを天板にのせ、チーズがこんがりと泡立つまで20〜25分ほど焼く。","image_alt":"チーズがこんがり焼けて泡立つ、焼き上がったばかりのなすボート","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"少し冷まして盛り付ける","content":"オーブンから取り出し、少し冷ましてから盛り付ける。","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"少し冷まして盛り付ける"}]},{"id":"c4bcd53e-b10b-4dce-a8d3-345485de73dd","expected_steps":[{"title":"Preaqueça o forno","content":"Preaqueça o forno a 200 °C."},{"title":"Esvazie as berinjelas","content":"Lave as berinjelas e corte-as ao meio no sentido do comprimento. Retire a polpa com cuidado, deixando uma borda de cerca de 1 centímetro. Reserve a polpa da berinjela.","image_alt":"Metades de berinjela esvaziadas com a polpa reservada sobre uma tábua de madeira","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Amoleça as berinjelas","content":"Coloque as metades de berinjela em uma assadeira e asse por 10 minutos para amolecê-las levemente. Depois, retire do forno e reserve."},{"title":"Refogue o alho, a cebola e o pimentão","content":"Em uma frigideira grande, aqueça o azeite em fogo médio. Adicione o alho picado, a cebola e o pimentão vermelho. Cozinhe até ficarem macios e levemente dourados.","image_alt":"Alho, cebola e pimentão vermelho sendo refogados em uma frigideira","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Doure a carne com a polpa da berinjela","content":"Adicione a carne moída à frigideira e cozinhe até dourar e cozinhar bem. Adicione a polpa de berinjela reservada e cozinhe por mais alguns minutos.","image_alt":"Carne moída dourando com a polpa da berinjela na frigideira","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Cozinhe o molho de tomate","content":"Despeje o tomate triturado na frigideira e tempere com sal, pimenta e orégano. Cozinhe em fogo baixo por 10-15 minutos para os sabores se misturarem bem.","image_alt":"Molho de tomate com carne e berinjela cozinhando em fogo baixo","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Recheie e cubra com queijo","content":"Recheie as metades de berinjela com a mistura de carne e tomate. Polvilhe queijo ralado sobre cada barquinho.","image_alt":"Barquinhos de berinjela recheados sendo cobertos com queijo ralado","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Asse os barquinhos","content":"Coloque os barquinhos de berinjela recheados em uma assadeira e asse por cerca de 20-25 minutos, ou até o queijo ficar dourado e borbulhante.","image_alt":"Barquinhos de berinjela recém-assados com o queijo dourado e borbulhante","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Deixe descansar e sirva","content":"Retire do forno e deixe esfriar um pouco antes de servir."}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Preaqueça o forno","content":"Preaqueça o forno a 200 °C.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Preaqueça o forno"},{"title":"Esvazie as berinjelas","content":"Lave as berinjelas e corte-as ao meio no sentido do comprimento. Retire a polpa com cuidado, deixando uma borda de cerca de 1 centímetro. Reserve a polpa da berinjela.","image_alt":"Metades de berinjela esvaziadas com a polpa reservada sobre uma tábua de madeira","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Amoleça as berinjelas","content":"Coloque as metades de berinjela em uma assadeira e asse por 10 minutos para amolecê-las levemente. Depois, retire do forno e reserve.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Amoleça as berinjelas"},{"title":"Refogue o alho, a cebola e o pimentão","content":"Em uma frigideira grande, aqueça o azeite em fogo médio. Adicione o alho picado, a cebola e o pimentão vermelho. Cozinhe até ficarem macios e levemente dourados.","image_alt":"Alho, cebola e pimentão vermelho sendo refogados em uma frigideira","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Doure a carne com a polpa da berinjela","content":"Adicione a carne moída à frigideira e cozinhe até dourar e cozinhar bem. Adicione a polpa de berinjela reservada e cozinhe por mais alguns minutos.","image_alt":"Carne moída dourando com a polpa da berinjela na frigideira","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Cozinhe o molho de tomate","content":"Despeje o tomate triturado na frigideira e tempere com sal, pimenta e orégano. Cozinhe em fogo baixo por 10-15 minutos para os sabores se misturarem bem.","image_alt":"Molho de tomate com carne e berinjela cozinhando em fogo baixo","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Recheie e cubra com queijo","content":"Recheie as metades de berinjela com a mistura de carne e tomate. Polvilhe queijo ralado sobre cada barquinho.","image_alt":"Barquinhos de berinjela recheados sendo cobertos com queijo ralado","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Asse os barquinhos","content":"Coloque os barquinhos de berinjela recheados em uma assadeira e asse por cerca de 20-25 minutos, ou até o queijo ficar dourado e borbulhante.","image_alt":"Barquinhos de berinjela recém-assados com o queijo dourado e borbulhante","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Deixe descansar e sirva","content":"Retire do forno e deixe esfriar um pouco antes de servir.","image_url":"/recetas/barquitos-de-berenjena-al-horno/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Deixe descansar e sirva"}]},{"id":"e089fa05-4f16-423f-9837-2b405be0b494","expected_steps":[{"title":"Reis abspülen","content":"Den Reis unter kaltem Wasser abspülen, um überschüssige Stärke zu entfernen."},{"title":"Zwiebel und Knoblauch andünsten","content":"In einem großen Topf die Butter schmelzen oder das Olivenöl bei mittlerer Hitze erhitzen. Die gehackte Zwiebel und den Knoblauch hinzufügen und andünsten, bis sie weich und duftend sind.","image_alt":"Zwiebel und Knoblauch dünsten in Butter in einem Topf","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Karotte und Erbsen hinzufügen","content":"Die Karotte und die Erbsen hinzufügen und einige Minuten kochen, bis sie weich sind.","image_alt":"Karotte und Erbsen werden dem Topf mit Zwiebel hinzugefügt","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Reis anrösten","content":"Den Reis hinzufügen und umrühren, damit er gut mit der Butter oder dem Öl überzogen ist. 1-2 Minuten kochen.","image_alt":"Reis brät mit Gemüse im Topf an","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Brühe angießen","content":"Die Hühner- oder Gemüsebrühe in den Topf gießen. Mit Salz, Pfeffer und Gewürzen nach Geschmack würzen. Zum Kochen bringen.","image_alt":"Brühe wird über den Reis und das Gemüse gegossen","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Zugedeckt garen","content":"Die Hitze auf niedrig reduzieren, den Topf abdecken und 15-20 Minuten garen, bis der Reis weich ist und die gesamte Flüssigkeit aufgenommen hat.","image_alt":"Abgedeckter Topf gart den Reis bei niedriger Hitze","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Ruhen lassen","content":"Den Topf vom Herd nehmen und zugedeckt 5 Minuten ruhen lassen."},{"title":"Reis auflockern","content":"Mit einer Gabel den Reis auflockern, um die Körner zu trennen und die restlichen Zutaten unterzumischen.","image_alt":"Pilaw-Reis wird mit einer Gabel im Topf aufgelockert","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Servieren","content":"Den Reis-Pilaw heiß als Beilage zu deinen Hauptgerichten servieren."}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Reis abspülen","content":"Den Reis unter kaltem Wasser abspülen, um überschüssige Stärke zu entfernen.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Reis abspülen"},{"title":"Zwiebel und Knoblauch andünsten","content":"In einem großen Topf die Butter schmelzen oder das Olivenöl bei mittlerer Hitze erhitzen. Die gehackte Zwiebel und den Knoblauch hinzufügen und andünsten, bis sie weich und duftend sind.","image_alt":"Zwiebel und Knoblauch dünsten in Butter in einem Topf","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Karotte und Erbsen hinzufügen","content":"Die Karotte und die Erbsen hinzufügen und einige Minuten kochen, bis sie weich sind.","image_alt":"Karotte und Erbsen werden dem Topf mit Zwiebel hinzugefügt","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Reis anrösten","content":"Den Reis hinzufügen und umrühren, damit er gut mit der Butter oder dem Öl überzogen ist. 1-2 Minuten kochen.","image_alt":"Reis brät mit Gemüse im Topf an","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Brühe angießen","content":"Die Hühner- oder Gemüsebrühe in den Topf gießen. Mit Salz, Pfeffer und Gewürzen nach Geschmack würzen. Zum Kochen bringen.","image_alt":"Brühe wird über den Reis und das Gemüse gegossen","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Zugedeckt garen","content":"Die Hitze auf niedrig reduzieren, den Topf abdecken und 15-20 Minuten garen, bis der Reis weich ist und die gesamte Flüssigkeit aufgenommen hat.","image_alt":"Abgedeckter Topf gart den Reis bei niedriger Hitze","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Ruhen lassen","content":"Den Topf vom Herd nehmen und zugedeckt 5 Minuten ruhen lassen.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Ruhen lassen"},{"title":"Reis auflockern","content":"Mit einer Gabel den Reis auflockern, um die Körner zu trennen und die restlichen Zutaten unterzumischen.","image_alt":"Pilaw-Reis wird mit einer Gabel im Topf aufgelockert","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Servieren","content":"Den Reis-Pilaw heiß als Beilage zu deinen Hauptgerichten servieren.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/portada.webp","image_alt":"Servieren"}]},{"id":"4850f21f-5661-45f8-b8e3-dd0d7b8bf644","expected_steps":[{"title":"Rinse the rice","content":"Rinse the rice under cold water to remove excess starch."},{"title":"Sauté the onion and garlic","content":"In a large saucepan, melt the butter or heat the olive oil over medium heat. Add the chopped onion and garlic, and sauté until soft and fragrant.","image_alt":"Onion and garlic sautéing in butter in a saucepan","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Add the carrot and peas","content":"Add the carrot and peas, and cook for a few minutes until tender.","image_alt":"Carrot and peas added to the saucepan with onion","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Toast the rice","content":"Add the rice and stir to coat it well with the butter or oil. Cook for 1-2 minutes.","image_alt":"Rice sautéing with vegetables in the saucepan","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Pour in the broth","content":"Pour the chicken or vegetable broth into the saucepan. Add salt, pepper and spices to taste. Bring to a boil.","image_alt":"Broth being poured over the rice and vegetables","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Cook covered","content":"Reduce the heat to low, cover the saucepan and cook for 15-20 minutes, or until the rice is tender and has absorbed all the liquid.","image_alt":"Covered saucepan cooking the rice over low heat","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Let it rest","content":"Remove the saucepan from the heat and let it rest, covered, for 5 minutes."},{"title":"Fluff the rice","content":"Using a fork, fluff the rice to separate the grains and mix in the additional ingredients.","image_alt":"Pilaf rice being fluffed with a fork in the saucepan","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Serve","content":"Serve the rice pilaf hot as a side dish to accompany your main courses."}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Rinse the rice","content":"Rinse the rice under cold water to remove excess starch.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Rinse the rice"},{"title":"Sauté the onion and garlic","content":"In a large saucepan, melt the butter or heat the olive oil over medium heat. Add the chopped onion and garlic, and sauté until soft and fragrant.","image_alt":"Onion and garlic sautéing in butter in a saucepan","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Add the carrot and peas","content":"Add the carrot and peas, and cook for a few minutes until tender.","image_alt":"Carrot and peas added to the saucepan with onion","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Toast the rice","content":"Add the rice and stir to coat it well with the butter or oil. Cook for 1-2 minutes.","image_alt":"Rice sautéing with vegetables in the saucepan","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Pour in the broth","content":"Pour the chicken or vegetable broth into the saucepan. Add salt, pepper and spices to taste. Bring to a boil.","image_alt":"Broth being poured over the rice and vegetables","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Cook covered","content":"Reduce the heat to low, cover the saucepan and cook for 15-20 minutes, or until the rice is tender and has absorbed all the liquid.","image_alt":"Covered saucepan cooking the rice over low heat","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Let it rest","content":"Remove the saucepan from the heat and let it rest, covered, for 5 minutes.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Let it rest"},{"title":"Fluff the rice","content":"Using a fork, fluff the rice to separate the grains and mix in the additional ingredients.","image_alt":"Pilaf rice being fluffed with a fork in the saucepan","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Serve","content":"Serve the rice pilaf hot as a side dish to accompany your main courses.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/portada.webp","image_alt":"Serve"}]},{"id":"e306a4bf-421c-4faa-9461-c1c0e11de127","expected_steps":[{"title":"Enjuaga el arroz","content":"Enjuaga el arroz con agua fría para eliminar el exceso de almidón."},{"title":"Sofríe cebolla y ajo","content":"En una cacerola grande, derrite la mantequilla o calienta el aceite de oliva a fuego medio. Agrega la cebolla picada y el ajo, y saltea hasta que estén suaves y fragantes.","image_alt":"Cebolla y ajo salteándose en mantequilla en una cacerola","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Añade zanahoria y guisantes","content":"Añade la zanahoria y los guisantes, y cocina por unos minutos hasta que estén tiernos.","image_alt":"Zanahoria y guisantes añadidos a la cacerola con cebolla","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Tuesta el arroz","content":"Agrega el arroz y revuélvelo para que se cubra bien con la mantequilla o el aceite. Cocina durante 1-2 minutos.","image_alt":"Arroz salteándose con verduras en la cacerola","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Vierte el caldo","content":"Vierte el caldo de pollo o vegetales en la cacerola. Agrega sal, pimienta y especias al gusto. Lleva a ebullición.","image_alt":"Caldo vertiéndose sobre el arroz y las verduras","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Cocina tapado","content":"Reduce el fuego a bajo, cubre la cacerola y cocina durante 15-20 minutos, o hasta que el arroz esté tierno y haya absorbido todo el líquido.","image_alt":"Cacerola tapada cociendo el arroz a fuego bajo","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Deja reposar","content":"Retira la cacerola del fuego y deja reposar tapada durante 5 minutos."},{"title":"Esponja el arroz","content":"Con un tenedor, esponja el arroz para separar los granos y mezclar los ingredientes adicionales.","image_alt":"Arroz pilaf esponjado con un tenedor en la cacerola","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Sirve","content":"Sirve el arroz pilaf caliente como guarnición para acompañar tus platos principales."}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Enjuaga el arroz","content":"Enjuaga el arroz con agua fría para eliminar el exceso de almidón.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Enjuaga el arroz"},{"title":"Sofríe cebolla y ajo","content":"En una cacerola grande, derrite la mantequilla o calienta el aceite de oliva a fuego medio. Agrega la cebolla picada y el ajo, y saltea hasta que estén suaves y fragantes.","image_alt":"Cebolla y ajo salteándose en mantequilla en una cacerola","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Añade zanahoria y guisantes","content":"Añade la zanahoria y los guisantes, y cocina por unos minutos hasta que estén tiernos.","image_alt":"Zanahoria y guisantes añadidos a la cacerola con cebolla","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Tuesta el arroz","content":"Agrega el arroz y revuélvelo para que se cubra bien con la mantequilla o el aceite. Cocina durante 1-2 minutos.","image_alt":"Arroz salteándose con verduras en la cacerola","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Vierte el caldo","content":"Vierte el caldo de pollo o vegetales en la cacerola. Agrega sal, pimienta y especias al gusto. Lleva a ebullición.","image_alt":"Caldo vertiéndose sobre el arroz y las verduras","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Cocina tapado","content":"Reduce el fuego a bajo, cubre la cacerola y cocina durante 15-20 minutos, o hasta que el arroz esté tierno y haya absorbido todo el líquido.","image_alt":"Cacerola tapada cociendo el arroz a fuego bajo","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Deja reposar","content":"Retira la cacerola del fuego y deja reposar tapada durante 5 minutos.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Deja reposar"},{"title":"Esponja el arroz","content":"Con un tenedor, esponja el arroz para separar los granos y mezclar los ingredientes adicionales.","image_alt":"Arroz pilaf esponjado con un tenedor en la cacerola","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Sirve","content":"Sirve el arroz pilaf caliente como guarnición para acompañar tus platos principales.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/portada.webp","image_alt":"Sirve"}]},{"id":"6429cada-7b0e-48f0-ac18-603fbf81f605","expected_steps":[{"title":"Rincez le riz","content":"Rincez le riz à l'eau froide pour éliminer l'excès d'amidon."},{"title":"Faites revenir l'oignon et l'ail","content":"Dans une grande casserole, faites fondre le beurre ou chauffez l'huile d'olive à feu moyen. Ajoutez l'oignon haché et l'ail, et faites revenir jusqu'à ce qu'ils soient tendres et parfumés.","image_alt":"Oignon et ail revenant dans du beurre dans une casserole","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Ajoutez la carotte et les petits pois","content":"Ajoutez la carotte et les petits pois, et faites cuire quelques minutes jusqu'à ce qu'ils soient tendres.","image_alt":"Carotte et petits pois ajoutés à la casserole avec l'oignon","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Faites revenir le riz","content":"Ajoutez le riz et remuez pour bien l'enrober de beurre ou d'huile. Faites cuire 1 à 2 minutes.","image_alt":"Riz revenant avec des légumes dans la casserole","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Versez le bouillon","content":"Versez le bouillon de poulet ou de légumes dans la casserole. Ajoutez du sel, du poivre et des épices selon votre goût. Portez à ébullition.","image_alt":"Bouillon versé sur le riz et les légumes","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Cuisez à couvert","content":"Réduisez le feu, couvrez la casserole et laissez cuire 15 à 20 minutes, jusqu'à ce que le riz soit tendre et ait absorbé tout le liquide.","image_alt":"Casserole couverte cuisant le riz à feu doux","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Laissez reposer","content":"Retirez la casserole du feu et laissez reposer à couvert pendant 5 minutes."},{"title":"Égrenez le riz","content":"À l'aide d'une fourchette, égrenez le riz pour séparer les grains et mélanger les ingrédients supplémentaires.","image_alt":"Riz pilaf égrené à la fourchette dans la casserole","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Servez","content":"Servez le riz pilaf chaud en accompagnement de vos plats principaux."}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Rincez le riz","content":"Rincez le riz à l'eau froide pour éliminer l'excès d'amidon.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Rincez le riz"},{"title":"Faites revenir l'oignon et l'ail","content":"Dans une grande casserole, faites fondre le beurre ou chauffez l'huile d'olive à feu moyen. Ajoutez l'oignon haché et l'ail, et faites revenir jusqu'à ce qu'ils soient tendres et parfumés.","image_alt":"Oignon et ail revenant dans du beurre dans une casserole","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Ajoutez la carotte et les petits pois","content":"Ajoutez la carotte et les petits pois, et faites cuire quelques minutes jusqu'à ce qu'ils soient tendres.","image_alt":"Carotte et petits pois ajoutés à la casserole avec l'oignon","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Faites revenir le riz","content":"Ajoutez le riz et remuez pour bien l'enrober de beurre ou d'huile. Faites cuire 1 à 2 minutes.","image_alt":"Riz revenant avec des légumes dans la casserole","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Versez le bouillon","content":"Versez le bouillon de poulet ou de légumes dans la casserole. Ajoutez du sel, du poivre et des épices selon votre goût. Portez à ébullition.","image_alt":"Bouillon versé sur le riz et les légumes","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Cuisez à couvert","content":"Réduisez le feu, couvrez la casserole et laissez cuire 15 à 20 minutes, jusqu'à ce que le riz soit tendre et ait absorbé tout le liquide.","image_alt":"Casserole couverte cuisant le riz à feu doux","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Laissez reposer","content":"Retirez la casserole du feu et laissez reposer à couvert pendant 5 minutes.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Laissez reposer"},{"title":"Égrenez le riz","content":"À l'aide d'une fourchette, égrenez le riz pour séparer les grains et mélanger les ingrédients supplémentaires.","image_alt":"Riz pilaf égrené à la fourchette dans la casserole","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Servez","content":"Servez le riz pilaf chaud en accompagnement de vos plats principaux.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/portada.webp","image_alt":"Servez"}]},{"id":"331ec414-0933-4555-a850-2beef50fb34a","expected_steps":[{"title":"Sciacqua il riso","content":"Sciacqua il riso con acqua fredda per eliminare l'amido in eccesso."},{"title":"Soffriggi cipolla e aglio","content":"In una casseruola grande, sciogli il burro o scalda l'olio d'oliva a fuoco medio. Aggiungi la cipolla tritata e l'aglio, e soffriggi finché sono morbidi e profumati.","image_alt":"Cipolla e aglio che soffriggono nel burro in una casseruola","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi carota e piselli","content":"Aggiungi la carota e i piselli, e cuoci per qualche minuto finché sono teneri.","image_alt":"Carota e piselli aggiunti alla casseruola con la cipolla","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Tosta il riso","content":"Aggiungi il riso e mescola per ricoprirlo bene di burro o olio. Cuoci per 1-2 minuti.","image_alt":"Riso che soffrigge con le verdure nella casseruola","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Versa il brodo","content":"Versa il brodo di pollo o vegetale nella casseruola. Aggiungi sale, pepe e spezie a piacere. Porta a ebollizione.","image_alt":"Brodo versato sul riso e sulle verdure","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Cuoci coperto","content":"Riduci il fuoco al minimo, copri la casseruola e cuoci per 15-20 minuti, finché il riso è tenero e ha assorbito tutto il liquido.","image_alt":"Casseruola coperta che cuoce il riso a fuoco basso","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Lascia riposare","content":"Togli la casseruola dal fuoco e lascia riposare coperto per 5 minuti."},{"title":"Sgrana il riso","content":"Con una forchetta, sgrana il riso per separare i chicchi e mescolare gli ingredienti aggiuntivi.","image_alt":"Riso pilaf sgranato con una forchetta nella casseruola","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Servi","content":"Servi il riso pilaf caldo come contorno per accompagnare i tuoi piatti principali."}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Sciacqua il riso","content":"Sciacqua il riso con acqua fredda per eliminare l'amido in eccesso.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Sciacqua il riso"},{"title":"Soffriggi cipolla e aglio","content":"In una casseruola grande, sciogli il burro o scalda l'olio d'oliva a fuoco medio. Aggiungi la cipolla tritata e l'aglio, e soffriggi finché sono morbidi e profumati.","image_alt":"Cipolla e aglio che soffriggono nel burro in una casseruola","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi carota e piselli","content":"Aggiungi la carota e i piselli, e cuoci per qualche minuto finché sono teneri.","image_alt":"Carota e piselli aggiunti alla casseruola con la cipolla","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Tosta il riso","content":"Aggiungi il riso e mescola per ricoprirlo bene di burro o olio. Cuoci per 1-2 minuti.","image_alt":"Riso che soffrigge con le verdure nella casseruola","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Versa il brodo","content":"Versa il brodo di pollo o vegetale nella casseruola. Aggiungi sale, pepe e spezie a piacere. Porta a ebollizione.","image_alt":"Brodo versato sul riso e sulle verdure","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Cuoci coperto","content":"Riduci il fuoco al minimo, copri la casseruola e cuoci per 15-20 minuti, finché il riso è tenero e ha assorbito tutto il liquido.","image_alt":"Casseruola coperta che cuoce il riso a fuoco basso","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Lascia riposare","content":"Togli la casseruola dal fuoco e lascia riposare coperto per 5 minuti.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Lascia riposare"},{"title":"Sgrana il riso","content":"Con una forchetta, sgrana il riso per separare i chicchi e mescolare gli ingredienti aggiuntivi.","image_alt":"Riso pilaf sgranato con una forchetta nella casseruola","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Servi","content":"Servi il riso pilaf caldo come contorno per accompagnare i tuoi piatti principali.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/portada.webp","image_alt":"Servi"}]},{"id":"50208613-ebc3-4567-b618-b81374b1830d","expected_steps":[{"title":"米を洗う","content":"米を冷水で洗い、余分なでんぷんを取り除く。"},{"title":"玉ねぎとにんにくを炒める","content":"大きめの鍋にバターを溶かすかオリーブオイルを中火で熱する。みじん切りにした玉ねぎとにんにくを加え、柔らかく香りが立つまで炒める。","image_alt":"鍋でバターと一緒に炒められる玉ねぎとにんにく","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"にんじんとグリーンピースを加える","content":"にんじんとグリーンピースを加え、柔らかくなるまで数分炒める。","image_alt":"玉ねぎの鍋ににんじんとグリーンピースが加えられる様子","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"米を炒める","content":"米を加えてバターまたはオイルをよくなじませるように混ぜる。1〜2分炒める。","image_alt":"野菜と一緒に鍋で炒められる米","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"スープを注ぐ","content":"鍋に鶏がらスープまたは野菜スープを注ぐ。塩、こしょう、スパイスをお好みで加え、煮立たせる。","image_alt":"米と野菜の上にスープが注がれる様子","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"蓋をして炊く","content":"弱火にして鍋に蓋をし、米が柔らかくなり水分を吸収するまで15〜20分炊く。","image_alt":"弱火で米を炊いている蓋をした鍋","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"蒸らす","content":"鍋を火から下ろし、蓋をしたまま5分蒸らす。"},{"title":"米をほぐす","content":"フォークで米をほぐして粒を分け、具材を全体に混ぜ合わせる。","image_alt":"鍋の中でフォークでほぐされるピラフ風の米","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"盛り付ける","content":"アロス・ピラフを温かいうちにメイン料理の付け合わせとして盛り付ける。"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"米を洗う","content":"米を冷水で洗い、余分なでんぷんを取り除く。","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"米を洗う"},{"title":"玉ねぎとにんにくを炒める","content":"大きめの鍋にバターを溶かすかオリーブオイルを中火で熱する。みじん切りにした玉ねぎとにんにくを加え、柔らかく香りが立つまで炒める。","image_alt":"鍋でバターと一緒に炒められる玉ねぎとにんにく","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"にんじんとグリーンピースを加える","content":"にんじんとグリーンピースを加え、柔らかくなるまで数分炒める。","image_alt":"玉ねぎの鍋ににんじんとグリーンピースが加えられる様子","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"米を炒める","content":"米を加えてバターまたはオイルをよくなじませるように混ぜる。1〜2分炒める。","image_alt":"野菜と一緒に鍋で炒められる米","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"スープを注ぐ","content":"鍋に鶏がらスープまたは野菜スープを注ぐ。塩、こしょう、スパイスをお好みで加え、煮立たせる。","image_alt":"米と野菜の上にスープが注がれる様子","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"蓋をして炊く","content":"弱火にして鍋に蓋をし、米が柔らかくなり水分を吸収するまで15〜20分炊く。","image_alt":"弱火で米を炊いている蓋をした鍋","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"蒸らす","content":"鍋を火から下ろし、蓋をしたまま5分蒸らす。","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"蒸らす"},{"title":"米をほぐす","content":"フォークで米をほぐして粒を分け、具材を全体に混ぜ合わせる。","image_alt":"鍋の中でフォークでほぐされるピラフ風の米","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"盛り付ける","content":"アロス・ピラフを温かいうちにメイン料理の付け合わせとして盛り付ける。","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/portada.webp","image_alt":"盛り付ける"}]},{"id":"d3b517b7-957b-4a4c-bc69-e0b57498d288","expected_steps":[{"title":"Lave o arroz","content":"Lave o arroz em água fria para remover o excesso de amido."},{"title":"Refogue a cebola e o alho","content":"Em uma panela grande, derreta a manteiga ou aqueça o azeite em fogo médio. Adicione a cebola picada e o alho, e refogue até ficarem macios e perfumados.","image_alt":"Cebola e alho sendo refogados na manteiga em uma panela","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Adicione a cenoura e as ervilhas","content":"Adicione a cenoura e as ervilhas, e cozinhe por alguns minutos até ficarem macias.","image_alt":"Cenoura e ervilhas adicionadas à panela com a cebola","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Toste o arroz","content":"Adicione o arroz e mexa para envolvê-lo bem com a manteiga ou o azeite. Cozinhe por 1-2 minutos.","image_alt":"Arroz sendo tostado com legumes na panela","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Adicione o caldo","content":"Adicione o caldo de frango ou de legumes na panela. Tempere com sal, pimenta e especiarias a gosto. Deixe ferver.","image_alt":"Caldo sendo despejado sobre o arroz e os legumes","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Cozinhe tampado","content":"Reduza o fogo, tampe a panela e cozinhe por 15-20 minutos, ou até o arroz ficar macio e ter absorvido todo o líquido.","image_alt":"Panela tampada cozinhando o arroz em fogo baixo","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Deixe descansar","content":"Retire a panela do fogo e deixe descansar tampada por 5 minutos."},{"title":"Solte o arroz","content":"Com um garfo, solte o arroz para separar os grãos e misturar os ingredientes adicionais.","image_alt":"Arroz pilaf sendo solto com um garfo na panela","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Sirva","content":"Sirva o arroz pilaf quente como acompanhamento para seus pratos principais."}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Lave o arroz","content":"Lave o arroz em água fria para remover o excesso de amido.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Lave o arroz"},{"title":"Refogue a cebola e o alho","content":"Em uma panela grande, derreta a manteiga ou aqueça o azeite em fogo médio. Adicione a cebola picada e o alho, e refogue até ficarem macios e perfumados.","image_alt":"Cebola e alho sendo refogados na manteiga em uma panela","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Adicione a cenoura e as ervilhas","content":"Adicione a cenoura e as ervilhas, e cozinhe por alguns minutos até ficarem macias.","image_alt":"Cenoura e ervilhas adicionadas à panela com a cebola","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Toste o arroz","content":"Adicione o arroz e mexa para envolvê-lo bem com a manteiga ou o azeite. Cozinhe por 1-2 minutos.","image_alt":"Arroz sendo tostado com legumes na panela","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Adicione o caldo","content":"Adicione o caldo de frango ou de legumes na panela. Tempere com sal, pimenta e especiarias a gosto. Deixe ferver.","image_alt":"Caldo sendo despejado sobre o arroz e os legumes","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Cozinhe tampado","content":"Reduza o fogo, tampe a panela e cozinhe por 15-20 minutos, ou até o arroz ficar macio e ter absorvido todo o líquido.","image_alt":"Panela tampada cozinhando o arroz em fogo baixo","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Deixe descansar","content":"Retire a panela do fogo e deixe descansar tampada por 5 minutos.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Deixe descansar"},{"title":"Solte o arroz","content":"Com um garfo, solte o arroz para separar os grãos e misturar os ingredientes adicionais.","image_alt":"Arroz pilaf sendo solto com um garfo na panela","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Sirva","content":"Sirva o arroz pilaf quente como acompanhamento para seus pratos principais.","image_url":"/recetas/arroz-pilaf/portada.webp","image_alt":"Sirva"}]},{"id":"9b1c65ab-d647-4063-b8d1-22334948568c","expected_steps":[{"title":"Knoblauch schälen","content":"Die Knoblauchzehen schälen.","image_alt":"Hände schälen Knoblauchzehen auf einem Holzbrett","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Basis pürieren","content":"Knoblauch, Eigelb, Milch, Essig, Oregano und eine Prise Salz in den Mixer geben und glatt pürieren.","image_alt":"Knoblauch, Eigelb, Milch, Essig und Oregano werden mit dem Stabmixer puriert","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Mit Öl emulgieren","content":"Bei laufendem Mixer das Öl in einem dünnen, langsamen Strahl einfließen lassen, bis die Sauce eindickt und cremig wird.","image_alt":"Öl fällt in dünnem Strahl in die Sauce, während sie mit dem Mixer emulgiert wird","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Konsistenz anpassen","content":"Falls mehr Bindung nötig ist, etwas eingeweichtes Weißbrot hinzufügen und erneut pürieren."},{"title":"Abschmecken","content":"Salz und Säure abschmecken und anpassen; nach Belieben den viertel Brühwürfel hinzufügen."},{"title":"Kühlen","content":"Die Sauce in einen sauberen Behälter umfüllen und mindestens 1 Stunde kühlen.","image_alt":"Glas mit Knoblauchsauce wird zum Aufbewahren im Kühlschrank verschlossen","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Servieren","content":"Kalt servieren und bis zum Verzehr gekühlt aufbewahren.","image_alt":"Löffel serviert Knoblauchsauce in eine Schale neben Brathähnchen und Kartoffeln","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-07.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Knoblauch schälen","content":"Die Knoblauchzehen schälen.","image_alt":"Hände schälen Knoblauchzehen auf einem Holzbrett","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Basis pürieren","content":"Knoblauch, Eigelb, Milch, Essig, Oregano und eine Prise Salz in den Mixer geben und glatt pürieren.","image_alt":"Knoblauch, Eigelb, Milch, Essig und Oregano werden mit dem Stabmixer puriert","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Mit Öl emulgieren","content":"Bei laufendem Mixer das Öl in einem dünnen, langsamen Strahl einfließen lassen, bis die Sauce eindickt und cremig wird.","image_alt":"Öl fällt in dünnem Strahl in die Sauce, während sie mit dem Mixer emulgiert wird","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Konsistenz anpassen","content":"Falls mehr Bindung nötig ist, etwas eingeweichtes Weißbrot hinzufügen und erneut pürieren.","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Konsistenz anpassen"},{"title":"Abschmecken","content":"Salz und Säure abschmecken und anpassen; nach Belieben den viertel Brühwürfel hinzufügen.","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-completo-05-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Abschmecken"},{"title":"Kühlen","content":"Die Sauce in einen sauberen Behälter umfüllen und mindestens 1 Stunde kühlen.","image_alt":"Glas mit Knoblauchsauce wird zum Aufbewahren im Kühlschrank verschlossen","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Servieren","content":"Kalt servieren und bis zum Verzehr gekühlt aufbewahren.","image_alt":"Löffel serviert Knoblauchsauce in eine Schale neben Brathähnchen und Kartoffeln","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-07.webp"}]},{"id":"f1ba9014-19df-4d7b-af27-8864240a0e2d","expected_steps":[{"title":"Peel the garlic","content":"Peel the garlic cloves.","image_alt":"Hands peeling garlic cloves on a wooden board","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Blend the base","content":"Put the garlic, egg yolks, milk, vinegar, oregano and a pinch of salt in the blender and blend until smooth.","image_alt":"Garlic, egg yolks, milk, vinegar and oregano blending with an immersion blender","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Emulsify with the oil","content":"With the blender running, pour in the oil in a thin, slow stream until the sauce thickens and turns creamy.","image_alt":"Oil falling in a thin stream into the sauce while it emulsifies with the blender","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Adjust the texture","content":"If it needs more body, add a small amount of soaked white bread and blend again."},{"title":"Season","content":"Taste and adjust the salt and acidity; if you like, add the quarter bouillon cube."},{"title":"Refrigerate","content":"Transfer the sauce to a clean container and refrigerate for at least 1 hour.","image_alt":"Jar of garlic sauce being closed to store in the fridge","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Serve","content":"Serve cold and keep refrigerated until ready to eat.","image_alt":"Spoon serving garlic sauce into a bowl next to roast chicken and potatoes","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-07.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Peel the garlic","content":"Peel the garlic cloves.","image_alt":"Hands peeling garlic cloves on a wooden board","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Blend the base","content":"Put the garlic, egg yolks, milk, vinegar, oregano and a pinch of salt in the blender and blend until smooth.","image_alt":"Garlic, egg yolks, milk, vinegar and oregano blending with an immersion blender","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Emulsify with the oil","content":"With the blender running, pour in the oil in a thin, slow stream until the sauce thickens and turns creamy.","image_alt":"Oil falling in a thin stream into the sauce while it emulsifies with the blender","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Adjust the texture","content":"If it needs more body, add a small amount of soaked white bread and blend again.","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Adjust the texture"},{"title":"Season","content":"Taste and adjust the salt and acidity; if you like, add the quarter bouillon cube.","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-completo-05-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Season"},{"title":"Refrigerate","content":"Transfer the sauce to a clean container and refrigerate for at least 1 hour.","image_alt":"Jar of garlic sauce being closed to store in the fridge","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Serve","content":"Serve cold and keep refrigerated until ready to eat.","image_alt":"Spoon serving garlic sauce into a bowl next to roast chicken and potatoes","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-07.webp"}]},{"id":"754c34db-4172-4273-95fc-99c1ba174db5","expected_steps":[{"title":"Pela el ajo","content":"Pela los dientes de ajo.","image_alt":"Manos pelando los dientes de ajo sobre una tabla de madera","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Tritura la base","content":"Pon el ajo, las yemas, la leche, el vinagre, el orégano y una pizca de sal en la batidora y tritura hasta obtener una mezcla uniforme.","image_alt":"Ajo, yemas, leche, vinagre y orégano triturándose con la batidora de brazo","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Emulsiona con el aceite","content":"Con la batidora en marcha, incorpora el aceite en un hilo fino y lento hasta que la salsa espese y quede cremosa.","image_alt":"Aceite en hilo fino cayendo en la salsa mientras se emulsiona con la batidora","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Ajusta la textura","content":"Si necesita más cuerpo, añade una pequeña cantidad de pan blanco hidratado y tritura de nuevo."},{"title":"Sazona","content":"Prueba y ajusta la sal y la acidez; si quieres, añade el cuarto de cubo de caldo de pollo."},{"title":"Refrigera","content":"Pasa la salsa a un recipiente limpio y refrigera al menos 1 hora.","image_alt":"Tarro de salsa de ajo cerrándose para guardarlo en la nevera","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Sirve","content":"Sirve fría y mantenla refrigerada hasta el momento de consumirla.","image_alt":"Cuchara sirviendo salsa de ajo sobre un bowl junto a pollo asado y patatas","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-07.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Pela el ajo","content":"Pela los dientes de ajo.","image_alt":"Manos pelando los dientes de ajo sobre una tabla de madera","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Tritura la base","content":"Pon el ajo, las yemas, la leche, el vinagre, el orégano y una pizca de sal en la batidora y tritura hasta obtener una mezcla uniforme.","image_alt":"Ajo, yemas, leche, vinagre y orégano triturándose con la batidora de brazo","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Emulsiona con el aceite","content":"Con la batidora en marcha, incorpora el aceite en un hilo fino y lento hasta que la salsa espese y quede cremosa.","image_alt":"Aceite en hilo fino cayendo en la salsa mientras se emulsiona con la batidora","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Ajusta la textura","content":"Si necesita más cuerpo, añade una pequeña cantidad de pan blanco hidratado y tritura de nuevo.","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Ajusta la textura"},{"title":"Sazona","content":"Prueba y ajusta la sal y la acidez; si quieres, añade el cuarto de cubo de caldo de pollo.","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-completo-05-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Sazona"},{"title":"Refrigera","content":"Pasa la salsa a un recipiente limpio y refrigera al menos 1 hora.","image_alt":"Tarro de salsa de ajo cerrándose para guardarlo en la nevera","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Sirve","content":"Sirve fría y mantenla refrigerada hasta el momento de consumirla.","image_alt":"Cuchara sirviendo salsa de ajo sobre un bowl junto a pollo asado y patatas","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-07.webp"}]},{"id":"ced8ee9f-7cad-4621-8764-bc6a5a821fc5","expected_steps":[{"title":"Épluche l'ail","content":"Épluche les gousses d'ail.","image_alt":"Mains épluchant des gousses d'ail sur une planche en bois","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Mixe la base","content":"Mets l'ail, les jaunes d'œuf, le lait, le vinaigre, l'origan et une pincée de sel dans le mixeur et mixe jusqu'à obtenir un mélange homogène.","image_alt":"Ail, jaunes d'œuf, lait, vinaigre et origan mixés au mixeur plongeant","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Émulsionne avec l'huile","content":"Mixeur en marche, verse l'huile en filet fin et lent jusqu'à ce que la sauce épaississe et devienne crémeuse.","image_alt":"Huile versée en filet fin dans la sauce pendant l'émulsion au mixeur","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Ajuste la texture","content":"Si elle a besoin de plus de corps, ajoute un peu de pain blanc trempé et mixe à nouveau."},{"title":"Assaisonne","content":"Goûte et ajuste le sel et l'acidité ; si tu veux, ajoute le quart de cube de bouillon de poulet."},{"title":"Réfrigère","content":"Transvase la sauce dans un récipient propre et laisse réfrigérer au moins 1 heure.","image_alt":"Pot de sauce à l'ail que l'on ferme pour le ranger au réfrigérateur","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Sers","content":"Sers froide et garde-la au réfrigérateur jusqu'au moment de la consommer.","image_alt":"Cuillère servant de la sauce à l'ail dans un bol à côté de poulet rôti et de pommes de terre","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-07.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Épluche l'ail","content":"Épluche les gousses d'ail.","image_alt":"Mains épluchant des gousses d'ail sur une planche en bois","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Mixe la base","content":"Mets l'ail, les jaunes d'œuf, le lait, le vinaigre, l'origan et une pincée de sel dans le mixeur et mixe jusqu'à obtenir un mélange homogène.","image_alt":"Ail, jaunes d'œuf, lait, vinaigre et origan mixés au mixeur plongeant","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Émulsionne avec l'huile","content":"Mixeur en marche, verse l'huile en filet fin et lent jusqu'à ce que la sauce épaississe et devienne crémeuse.","image_alt":"Huile versée en filet fin dans la sauce pendant l'émulsion au mixeur","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Ajuste la texture","content":"Si elle a besoin de plus de corps, ajoute un peu de pain blanc trempé et mixe à nouveau.","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Ajuste la texture"},{"title":"Assaisonne","content":"Goûte et ajuste le sel et l'acidité ; si tu veux, ajoute le quart de cube de bouillon de poulet.","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-completo-05-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Assaisonne"},{"title":"Réfrigère","content":"Transvase la sauce dans un récipient propre et laisse réfrigérer au moins 1 heure.","image_alt":"Pot de sauce à l'ail que l'on ferme pour le ranger au réfrigérateur","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Sers","content":"Sers froide et garde-la au réfrigérateur jusqu'au moment de la consommer.","image_alt":"Cuillère servant de la sauce à l'ail dans un bol à côté de poulet rôti et de pommes de terre","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-07.webp"}]},{"id":"9c39a828-5c5a-413c-be97-1c529be03dfc","expected_steps":[{"title":"Pela l'aglio","content":"Pela gli spicchi d'aglio.","image_alt":"Mani che pelano spicchi d'aglio su un tagliere di legno","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Frulla la base","content":"Metti l'aglio, i tuorli, il latte, l'aceto, l'origano e un pizzico di sale nel frullatore e frulla fino a ottenere un composto omogeneo.","image_alt":"Aglio, tuorli, latte, aceto e origano frullati con il frullatore a immersione","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Emulsiona con l'olio","content":"Con il frullatore in funzione, versa l'olio a filo sottile e lento finché la salsa si addensa e diventa cremosa.","image_alt":"Olio versato a filo sottile nella salsa mentre si emulsiona con il frullatore","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Regola la consistenza","content":"Se serve più corpo, aggiungi una piccola quantità di pane bianco ammollato e frulla di nuovo."},{"title":"Condisci","content":"Assaggia e regola il sale e l'acidità; se vuoi, aggiungi il quarto di dado di pollo."},{"title":"Refrigera","content":"Trasferisci la salsa in un contenitore pulito e lascia in frigorifero almeno 1 ora.","image_alt":"Barattolo di salsa all'aglio chiuso per riporlo in frigorifero","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Servi","content":"Servi fredda e mantienila in frigorifero fino al momento di consumarla.","image_alt":"Cucchiaio che serve la salsa all'aglio in una ciotola accanto a pollo arrosto e patate","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-07.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Pela l'aglio","content":"Pela gli spicchi d'aglio.","image_alt":"Mani che pelano spicchi d'aglio su un tagliere di legno","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Frulla la base","content":"Metti l'aglio, i tuorli, il latte, l'aceto, l'origano e un pizzico di sale nel frullatore e frulla fino a ottenere un composto omogeneo.","image_alt":"Aglio, tuorli, latte, aceto e origano frullati con il frullatore a immersione","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Emulsiona con l'olio","content":"Con il frullatore in funzione, versa l'olio a filo sottile e lento finché la salsa si addensa e diventa cremosa.","image_alt":"Olio versato a filo sottile nella salsa mentre si emulsiona con il frullatore","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Regola la consistenza","content":"Se serve più corpo, aggiungi una piccola quantità di pane bianco ammollato e frulla di nuovo.","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Regola la consistenza"},{"title":"Condisci","content":"Assaggia e regola il sale e l'acidità; se vuoi, aggiungi il quarto di dado di pollo.","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-completo-05-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Condisci"},{"title":"Refrigera","content":"Trasferisci la salsa in un contenitore pulito e lascia in frigorifero almeno 1 ora.","image_alt":"Barattolo di salsa all'aglio chiuso per riporlo in frigorifero","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Servi","content":"Servi fredda e mantienila in frigorifero fino al momento di consumarla.","image_alt":"Cucchiaio che serve la salsa all'aglio in una ciotola accanto a pollo arrosto e patate","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-07.webp"}]},{"id":"8948c0d4-b570-43e7-aa1e-c62665cdb70e","expected_steps":[{"title":"にんにくの皮をむく","content":"にんにくの皮をむく。","image_alt":"木のまな板の上でにんにくの皮をむく手元","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"ベースを混ぜる","content":"にんにく、卵黄、牛乳、酢、オレガノ、塩ひとつまみをミキサーに入れ、なめらかになるまで混ぜる。","image_alt":"にんにく、卵黄、牛乳、酢、オレガノをハンドブレンダーで混ぜる様子","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"油で乳化させる","content":"ミキサーを回したまま、油を細く少しずつ注ぎ入れ、とろみがついてクリーミーになるまで続ける。","image_alt":"ミキサーで乳化させながら細く油を注ぐ様子","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"とろみを調整する","content":"とろみが足りない場合は、少量の牛乳に浸した食パンを加えて再度混ぜる。"},{"title":"味を調える","content":"味見をして塩と酸味を調整する。お好みでブイヨンを4分の1個加える。"},{"title":"冷蔵する","content":"清潔な容器にソースを移し、冷蔵庫で最低1時間冷やす。","image_alt":"保存のために蓋を閉めるガーリックソースの瓶","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"盛り付ける","content":"冷たいまま出し、食べるまで冷蔵庫で保存する。","image_alt":"ローストチキンとポテトの横のボウルにガーリックソースを盛り付けるスプーン","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-07.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"にんにくの皮をむく","content":"にんにくの皮をむく。","image_alt":"木のまな板の上でにんにくの皮をむく手元","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"ベースを混ぜる","content":"にんにく、卵黄、牛乳、酢、オレガノ、塩ひとつまみをミキサーに入れ、なめらかになるまで混ぜる。","image_alt":"にんにく、卵黄、牛乳、酢、オレガノをハンドブレンダーで混ぜる様子","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"油で乳化させる","content":"ミキサーを回したまま、油を細く少しずつ注ぎ入れ、とろみがついてクリーミーになるまで続ける。","image_alt":"ミキサーで乳化させながら細く油を注ぐ様子","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"とろみを調整する","content":"とろみが足りない場合は、少量の牛乳に浸した食パンを加えて再度混ぜる。","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"とろみを調整する"},{"title":"味を調える","content":"味見をして塩と酸味を調整する。お好みでブイヨンを4分の1個加える。","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-completo-05-20261103.webp","image_alt":"味を調える"},{"title":"冷蔵する","content":"清潔な容器にソースを移し、冷蔵庫で最低1時間冷やす。","image_alt":"保存のために蓋を閉めるガーリックソースの瓶","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"盛り付ける","content":"冷たいまま出し、食べるまで冷蔵庫で保存する。","image_alt":"ローストチキンとポテトの横のボウルにガーリックソースを盛り付けるスプーン","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-07.webp"}]},{"id":"32ce71b6-3863-4686-9826-0cb8906f71a7","expected_steps":[{"title":"Descasque o alho","content":"Descasque os dentes de alho.","image_alt":"Mãos descascando dentes de alho sobre uma tábua de madeira","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Bata a base","content":"Coloque o alho, as gemas, o leite, o vinagre, o orégano e uma pitada de sal no liquidificador e bata até ficar homogêneo.","image_alt":"Alho, gemas, leite, vinagre e orégano sendo batidos com o mixer de mão","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Emulsione com o óleo","content":"Com o liquidificador ligado, adicione o óleo em fio fino e devagar até o molho engrossar e ficar cremoso.","image_alt":"Óleo caindo em fio fino no molho enquanto emulsiona com o mixer","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Ajuste a textura","content":"Se precisar de mais corpo, adicione uma pequena quantidade de pão branco hidratado e bata novamente."},{"title":"Tempere","content":"Prove e ajuste o sal e a acidez; se quiser, adicione o quarto de cubo de caldo de galinha."},{"title":"Refrigere","content":"Transfira o molho para um recipiente limpo e leve a geladeira por pelo menos 1 hora.","image_alt":"Pote de molho de alho sendo fechado para guardar na geladeira","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Sirva","content":"Sirva frio e mantenha na geladeira até o momento de consumir.","image_alt":"Colher servindo molho de alho numa tigela ao lado de frango assado e batatas","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-07.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Descasque o alho","content":"Descasque os dentes de alho.","image_alt":"Mãos descascando dentes de alho sobre uma tábua de madeira","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Bata a base","content":"Coloque o alho, as gemas, o leite, o vinagre, o orégano e uma pitada de sal no liquidificador e bata até ficar homogêneo.","image_alt":"Alho, gemas, leite, vinagre e orégano sendo batidos com o mixer de mão","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Emulsione com o óleo","content":"Com o liquidificador ligado, adicione o óleo em fio fino e devagar até o molho engrossar e ficar cremoso.","image_alt":"Óleo caindo em fio fino no molho enquanto emulsiona com o mixer","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Ajuste a textura","content":"Se precisar de mais corpo, adicione uma pequena quantidade de pão branco hidratado e bata novamente.","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Ajuste a textura"},{"title":"Tempere","content":"Prove e ajuste o sal e a acidez; se quiser, adicione o quarto de cubo de caldo de galinha.","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-completo-05-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Tempere"},{"title":"Refrigere","content":"Transfira o molho para um recipiente limpo e leve a geladeira por pelo menos 1 hora.","image_alt":"Pote de molho de alho sendo fechado para guardar na geladeira","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Sirva","content":"Sirva frio e mantenha na geladeira até o momento de consumir.","image_alt":"Colher servindo molho de alho numa tigela ao lado de frango assado e batatas","image_url":"/recetas/salsa-ajo/paso-07.webp"}]},{"id":"bc8bca24-16fd-4a45-b7d9-07280aa0ebc5","expected_steps":[{"title":"Reis einweichen","content":"Die 50 g Reis in den 300 ml Wasser 8 Stunden im Kühlschrank bei höchstens 4 °C einweichen."},{"title":"Reis pürieren","content":"Den abgetropften Reis mit 250 ml der Milch 2 Minuten sehr fein pürieren. Das Einweichwasser wird nicht verwendet."},{"title":"Mischung sieben","content":"Durch ein feines Sieb in einen breiten Topf mit dickem Boden geben, dabei leicht ausdrücken; grobe Rückstände verwerfen.","image_alt":"Mischung sieben","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Zutaten mischen","content":"Die gesiebte Flüssigkeit mit den übrigen 1750 ml Milch und 400 g Zucker im Topf mischen."},{"title":"Langsam einkochen","content":"Offen bei kleiner Hitze 150–180 Minuten sanft köcheln, dabei Boden und Seiten ununterbrochen rühren, bis die Masse beige und dick wird.","image_alt":"Langsam einkochen","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Konsistenz prüfen","content":"Die Masse ist fertig, wenn sie sich vom Topf löst und eine Löffelspur den Boden 2–3 Sekunden freilegt. Ein Teelöffel auf einem kalten Teller soll nach 1 Minute seine Form behalten; sonst weitergaren.","image_alt":"Konsistenz prüfen","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Manjar portionieren","content":"Das heiße Manjar sofort nach Erreichen des richtigen Punktes in flache hitzefeste Gefäße füllen. Beim Abkühlen wird es noch fester.","image_alt":"Manjar portionieren","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Manjar abkühlen","content":"In flachen Gefäßen abkühlen und innerhalb von 2 Stunden in den Kühlschrank stellen. Dort 4 Stunden bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen.","image_alt":"Manjar abkühlen","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Servieren","content":"Eine der 20 Portionen pur oder im Dezember mit Buñuelos und kolumbianischer Natilla servieren.","image_alt":"Servieren","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/portada.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Reis einweichen","content":"Die 50 g Reis in den 300 ml Wasser 8 Stunden im Kühlschrank bei höchstens 4 °C einweichen.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Reis einweichen"},{"title":"Reis pürieren","content":"Den abgetropften Reis mit 250 ml der Milch 2 Minuten sehr fein pürieren. Das Einweichwasser wird nicht verwendet.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-02-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Reis pürieren"},{"title":"Mischung sieben","content":"Durch ein feines Sieb in einen breiten Topf mit dickem Boden geben, dabei leicht ausdrücken; grobe Rückstände verwerfen.","image_alt":"Mischung sieben","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Zutaten mischen","content":"Die gesiebte Flüssigkeit mit den übrigen 1750 ml Milch und 400 g Zucker im Topf mischen.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Zutaten mischen"},{"title":"Langsam einkochen","content":"Offen bei kleiner Hitze 150–180 Minuten sanft köcheln, dabei Boden und Seiten ununterbrochen rühren, bis die Masse beige und dick wird.","image_alt":"Langsam einkochen","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Konsistenz prüfen","content":"Die Masse ist fertig, wenn sie sich vom Topf löst und eine Löffelspur den Boden 2–3 Sekunden freilegt. Ein Teelöffel auf einem kalten Teller soll nach 1 Minute seine Form behalten; sonst weitergaren.","image_alt":"Konsistenz prüfen","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Manjar portionieren","content":"Das heiße Manjar sofort nach Erreichen des richtigen Punktes in flache hitzefeste Gefäße füllen. Beim Abkühlen wird es noch fester.","image_alt":"Manjar portionieren","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Manjar abkühlen","content":"In flachen Gefäßen abkühlen und innerhalb von 2 Stunden in den Kühlschrank stellen. Dort 4 Stunden bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen.","image_alt":"Manjar abkühlen","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Servieren","content":"Eine der 20 Portionen pur oder im Dezember mit Buñuelos und kolumbianischer Natilla servieren.","image_alt":"Servieren","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/portada.webp"}]},{"id":"e3098898-513e-4455-846c-467d89d58c46","expected_steps":[{"title":"Soak the rice","content":"Soak the 50 g rice in the 300 ml water for 8 hours in the refrigerator at 4 °C or below."},{"title":"Blend the rice","content":"Blend the drained rice with 250 ml of the milk for 2 minutes, until very fine. Discard the soaking water."},{"title":"Strain the mixture","content":"Strain through a fine sieve into a wide heavy-bottomed pot, pressing gently to collect the liquid; discard the coarse residue.","image_alt":"Strain the mixture","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Combine the ingredients","content":"Combine the strained liquid with the remaining 1750 ml milk and 400 g sugar in the pot."},{"title":"Cook slowly","content":"Cook uncovered over low heat for 150–180 minutes at a gentle simmer, stirring the bottom and sides continuously until thick and beige.","image_alt":"Cook slowly","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Check the setting point","content":"The mixture is ready when it pulls away from the pan and a spoon leaves the bottom visible for 2–3 seconds. A teaspoon on a cold plate should hold its shape after 1 minute; if it spreads, keep cooking.","image_alt":"Check the setting point","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Portion the manjar","content":"Portion the hot manjar into shallow heatproof containers as soon as it reaches the setting point. It firms up further as it cools.","image_alt":"Portion the manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Cool the manjar","content":"Cool in shallow containers and refrigerate within 2 hours. Chill for 4 hours at 4 °C or below.","image_alt":"Cool the manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Serve","content":"Serve 1 of the 20 portions on its own or with buñuelos and Colombian natilla for a December celebration.","image_alt":"Serve","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/portada.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Soak the rice","content":"Soak the 50 g rice in the 300 ml water for 8 hours in the refrigerator at 4 °C or below.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Soak the rice"},{"title":"Blend the rice","content":"Blend the drained rice with 250 ml of the milk for 2 minutes, until very fine. Discard the soaking water.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-02-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Blend the rice"},{"title":"Strain the mixture","content":"Strain through a fine sieve into a wide heavy-bottomed pot, pressing gently to collect the liquid; discard the coarse residue.","image_alt":"Strain the mixture","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Combine the ingredients","content":"Combine the strained liquid with the remaining 1750 ml milk and 400 g sugar in the pot.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Combine the ingredients"},{"title":"Cook slowly","content":"Cook uncovered over low heat for 150–180 minutes at a gentle simmer, stirring the bottom and sides continuously until thick and beige.","image_alt":"Cook slowly","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Check the setting point","content":"The mixture is ready when it pulls away from the pan and a spoon leaves the bottom visible for 2–3 seconds. A teaspoon on a cold plate should hold its shape after 1 minute; if it spreads, keep cooking.","image_alt":"Check the setting point","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Portion the manjar","content":"Portion the hot manjar into shallow heatproof containers as soon as it reaches the setting point. It firms up further as it cools.","image_alt":"Portion the manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Cool the manjar","content":"Cool in shallow containers and refrigerate within 2 hours. Chill for 4 hours at 4 °C or below.","image_alt":"Cool the manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Serve","content":"Serve 1 of the 20 portions on its own or with buñuelos and Colombian natilla for a December celebration.","image_alt":"Serve","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/portada.webp"}]},{"id":"69fad47c-dedc-4ed3-bac2-34ed908d2d91","expected_steps":[{"title":"Remoja el arroz","content":"Remoja los 50 g de arroz en los 300 ml de agua durante 8 horas en nevera a 4 °C o menos."},{"title":"Licúa el arroz","content":"Licúa el arroz escurrido con 250 ml de la leche durante 2 minutos, hasta obtener una mezcla muy fina. El agua de remojo se desecha."},{"title":"Cuela la mezcla","content":"Pasa la mezcla por un colador fino sobre una olla ancha de fondo grueso; presiona suavemente para extraer el líquido y desecha el residuo grueso.","image_alt":"Cuela la mezcla","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Mezcla los ingredientes","content":"Mezcla el colado con los 1750 ml de leche restantes y los 400 g de azúcar en la olla."},{"title":"Cocina lentamente","content":"Cocina destapado a fuego bajo durante 150–180 minutos, con hervor suave y revolviendo sin parar por el fondo y los bordes, hasta que tome color beige y espese.","image_alt":"Cocina lentamente","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Comprueba el punto","content":"El manjar está listo cuando se despega de la olla y la cuchara deja el fondo visible 2–3 segundos. Una cucharadita en un plato frío debe mantener su forma tras 1 minuto; si se extiende, continúa la cocción.","image_alt":"Comprueba el punto","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Reparte el manjar","content":"Reparte el manjar caliente en recipientes bajos resistentes al calor en cuanto alcance el punto. El dulce se afirma más al enfriarse.","image_alt":"Reparte el manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Enfría el manjar","content":"Enfría en recipientes poco profundos y refrigera antes de que pasen 2 horas. Déjalo 4 horas en nevera a 4 °C o menos.","image_alt":"Enfría el manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Sirve","content":"Sirve 1 de las 20 porciones, solo o junto a buñuelos y natilla en la mesa de diciembre.","image_alt":"Sirve","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/portada.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Remoja el arroz","content":"Remoja los 50 g de arroz en los 300 ml de agua durante 8 horas en nevera a 4 °C o menos.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Remoja el arroz"},{"title":"Licúa el arroz","content":"Licúa el arroz escurrido con 250 ml de la leche durante 2 minutos, hasta obtener una mezcla muy fina. El agua de remojo se desecha.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-02-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Licúa el arroz"},{"title":"Cuela la mezcla","content":"Pasa la mezcla por un colador fino sobre una olla ancha de fondo grueso; presiona suavemente para extraer el líquido y desecha el residuo grueso.","image_alt":"Cuela la mezcla","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Mezcla los ingredientes","content":"Mezcla el colado con los 1750 ml de leche restantes y los 400 g de azúcar en la olla.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Mezcla los ingredientes"},{"title":"Cocina lentamente","content":"Cocina destapado a fuego bajo durante 150–180 minutos, con hervor suave y revolviendo sin parar por el fondo y los bordes, hasta que tome color beige y espese.","image_alt":"Cocina lentamente","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Comprueba el punto","content":"El manjar está listo cuando se despega de la olla y la cuchara deja el fondo visible 2–3 segundos. Una cucharadita en un plato frío debe mantener su forma tras 1 minuto; si se extiende, continúa la cocción.","image_alt":"Comprueba el punto","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Reparte el manjar","content":"Reparte el manjar caliente en recipientes bajos resistentes al calor en cuanto alcance el punto. El dulce se afirma más al enfriarse.","image_alt":"Reparte el manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Enfría el manjar","content":"Enfría en recipientes poco profundos y refrigera antes de que pasen 2 horas. Déjalo 4 horas en nevera a 4 °C o menos.","image_alt":"Enfría el manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Sirve","content":"Sirve 1 de las 20 porciones, solo o junto a buñuelos y natilla en la mesa de diciembre.","image_alt":"Sirve","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/portada.webp"}]},{"id":"e7ee6f37-a9ff-4cec-8585-097b0e301110","expected_steps":[{"title":"Faites tremper le riz","content":"Faites tremper les 50 g de riz dans les 300 ml d’eau pendant 8 heures au réfrigérateur à 4 °C maximum."},{"title":"Mixez le riz","content":"Mixez le riz égoutté avec 250 ml du lait pendant 2 minutes, jusqu’à obtenir une texture très fine. L’eau de trempage est jetée."},{"title":"Filtrez le mélange","content":"Filtrez dans une passoire fine au-dessus d’une casserole large à fond épais, en pressant doucement ; jetez les résidus grossiers.","image_alt":"Filtrez le mélange","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Mélangez les ingrédients","content":"Mélangez le liquide filtré avec les 1750 ml de lait restants et les 400 g de sucre dans la casserole."},{"title":"Faites réduire doucement","content":"Cuisez à découvert et à feu doux 150–180 minutes, à petits frémissements, en remuant sans arrêt le fond et les bords, jusqu’à épaississement et coloration beige.","image_alt":"Faites réduire doucement","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Vérifiez le point","content":"Le mélange est prêt lorsqu’il se détache de la casserole et laisse le fond visible 2–3 secondes après le passage de la cuillère. Une cuillerée sur une assiette froide doit garder sa forme après 1 minute ; sinon, poursuivez la cuisson.","image_alt":"Vérifiez le point","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Répartissez le manjar","content":"Répartissez le manjar chaud dans des récipients bas résistants à la chaleur dès que le point est atteint. Il raffermit encore en refroidissant.","image_alt":"Répartissez le manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Faites refroidir","content":"Faites refroidir dans des récipients peu profonds et réfrigérez avant 2 heures. Laissez 4 heures au réfrigérateur à 4 °C maximum.","image_alt":"Faites refroidir","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Servez","content":"Servez une des 20 portions seule ou avec buñuelos et natilla colombienne pour les fêtes de décembre.","image_alt":"Servez","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/portada.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Faites tremper le riz","content":"Faites tremper les 50 g de riz dans les 300 ml d’eau pendant 8 heures au réfrigérateur à 4 °C maximum.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Faites tremper le riz"},{"title":"Mixez le riz","content":"Mixez le riz égoutté avec 250 ml du lait pendant 2 minutes, jusqu’à obtenir une texture très fine. L’eau de trempage est jetée.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-02-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Mixez le riz"},{"title":"Filtrez le mélange","content":"Filtrez dans une passoire fine au-dessus d’une casserole large à fond épais, en pressant doucement ; jetez les résidus grossiers.","image_alt":"Filtrez le mélange","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Mélangez les ingrédients","content":"Mélangez le liquide filtré avec les 1750 ml de lait restants et les 400 g de sucre dans la casserole.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Mélangez les ingrédients"},{"title":"Faites réduire doucement","content":"Cuisez à découvert et à feu doux 150–180 minutes, à petits frémissements, en remuant sans arrêt le fond et les bords, jusqu’à épaississement et coloration beige.","image_alt":"Faites réduire doucement","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Vérifiez le point","content":"Le mélange est prêt lorsqu’il se détache de la casserole et laisse le fond visible 2–3 secondes après le passage de la cuillère. Une cuillerée sur une assiette froide doit garder sa forme après 1 minute ; sinon, poursuivez la cuisson.","image_alt":"Vérifiez le point","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Répartissez le manjar","content":"Répartissez le manjar chaud dans des récipients bas résistants à la chaleur dès que le point est atteint. Il raffermit encore en refroidissant.","image_alt":"Répartissez le manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Faites refroidir","content":"Faites refroidir dans des récipients peu profonds et réfrigérez avant 2 heures. Laissez 4 heures au réfrigérateur à 4 °C maximum.","image_alt":"Faites refroidir","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Servez","content":"Servez une des 20 portions seule ou avec buñuelos et natilla colombienne pour les fêtes de décembre.","image_alt":"Servez","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/portada.webp"}]},{"id":"4b2c5140-53c6-4cb2-b384-983ce8cba3ad","expected_steps":[{"title":"Metti in ammollo il riso","content":"Lascia i 50 g di riso nei 300 ml d’acqua per 8 ore in frigorifero a 4 °C o meno."},{"title":"Frulla il riso","content":"Frulla il riso scolato con 250 ml del latte per 2 minuti, fino a renderlo finissimo. L’acqua di ammollo va eliminata."},{"title":"Filtra il composto","content":"Filtra con un colino fine sopra una pentola larga a fondo spesso, premendo delicatamente; elimina i residui grossolani.","image_alt":"Filtra il composto","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Mescola gli ingredienti","content":"Mescola il liquido filtrato con i restanti 1750 ml di latte e i 400 g di zucchero nella pentola."},{"title":"Cuoci lentamente","content":"Cuoci scoperto a fuoco basso per 150–180 minuti, a leggero bollore, mescolando senza fermarti sul fondo e sui bordi finché il composto diventa denso e beige.","image_alt":"Cuoci lentamente","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Controlla il punto","content":"È pronto quando si stacca dalla pentola e il passaggio del cucchiaio lascia il fondo visibile per 2–3 secondi. Un cucchiaino su un piattino freddo deve mantenere la forma dopo 1 minuto; altrimenti continua la cottura.","image_alt":"Controlla il punto","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Distribuisci il manjar","content":"Distribuisci subito il manjar caldo in contenitori bassi resistenti al calore quando raggiunge il punto. Raffreddandosi diventerà ancora più sodo.","image_alt":"Distribuisci il manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Fai raffreddare","content":"Fai raffreddare in contenitori bassi e metti in frigorifero entro 2 ore. Lascia 4 ore a 4 °C o meno.","image_alt":"Fai raffreddare","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Servi","content":"Servi una delle 20 porzioni da sola o con buñuelos e natilla colombiana per le feste di dicembre.","image_alt":"Servi","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/portada.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Metti in ammollo il riso","content":"Lascia i 50 g di riso nei 300 ml d’acqua per 8 ore in frigorifero a 4 °C o meno.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Metti in ammollo il riso"},{"title":"Frulla il riso","content":"Frulla il riso scolato con 250 ml del latte per 2 minuti, fino a renderlo finissimo. L’acqua di ammollo va eliminata.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-02-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Frulla il riso"},{"title":"Filtra il composto","content":"Filtra con un colino fine sopra una pentola larga a fondo spesso, premendo delicatamente; elimina i residui grossolani.","image_alt":"Filtra il composto","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Mescola gli ingredienti","content":"Mescola il liquido filtrato con i restanti 1750 ml di latte e i 400 g di zucchero nella pentola.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Mescola gli ingredienti"},{"title":"Cuoci lentamente","content":"Cuoci scoperto a fuoco basso per 150–180 minuti, a leggero bollore, mescolando senza fermarti sul fondo e sui bordi finché il composto diventa denso e beige.","image_alt":"Cuoci lentamente","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Controlla il punto","content":"È pronto quando si stacca dalla pentola e il passaggio del cucchiaio lascia il fondo visibile per 2–3 secondi. Un cucchiaino su un piattino freddo deve mantenere la forma dopo 1 minuto; altrimenti continua la cottura.","image_alt":"Controlla il punto","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Distribuisci il manjar","content":"Distribuisci subito il manjar caldo in contenitori bassi resistenti al calore quando raggiunge il punto. Raffreddandosi diventerà ancora più sodo.","image_alt":"Distribuisci il manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Fai raffreddare","content":"Fai raffreddare in contenitori bassi e metti in frigorifero entro 2 ore. Lascia 4 ore a 4 °C o meno.","image_alt":"Fai raffreddare","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Servi","content":"Servi una delle 20 porzioni da sola o con buñuelos e natilla colombiana per le feste di dicembre.","image_alt":"Servi","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/portada.webp"}]},{"id":"c16ea4f0-7150-478b-abf8-a8035cb345aa","expected_steps":[{"title":"米を浸す","content":"米50 gを水300 mlに入れ、4 °C以下の冷蔵庫で8時間浸します。"},{"title":"米をかくはんする","content":"水を切った米と分量の牛乳250 mlをミキサーで2分かくはんし、細かくします。浸していた水は使いません。"},{"title":"混合液をこす","content":"厚底の広い鍋に目の細かいざるを重ね、混合液を軽く押しながらこします。粗い残りは取り除きます。","image_alt":"混合液をこす","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"材料を混ぜる","content":"こした液体に残りの牛乳1750 mlと砂糖400 gを混ぜます。"},{"title":"ゆっくり煮詰める","content":"ふたをせず、弱火で150〜180分静かに煮ます。鍋底と側面を休まず混ぜ、ベージュ色で濃厚な状態にします。","image_alt":"ゆっくり煮詰める","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"仕上がりを確かめる","content":"生地が鍋から離れ、へらの筋から鍋底が2〜3秒見えれば仕上がりの目安です。冷たい皿に小さじ1杯のせ、1分後も形を保つことを確認します。広がる場合は煮詰め続けます。","image_alt":"仕上がりを確かめる","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"器に分ける","content":"仕上がったら熱いうちに浅い耐熱容器に分けます。冷めるとさらに固くなります。","image_alt":"器に分ける","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"冷やす","content":"浅い容器で粗熱を取り、2時間以内に冷蔵します。4 °C以下の冷蔵庫で4時間冷やします。","image_alt":"冷やす","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"盛り付ける","content":"20人分のうち1人分を盛り付けます。そのままでも、12月の食卓でブニュエロやナティージャに添えても楽しめます。","image_alt":"盛り付ける","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/portada.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"米を浸す","content":"米50 gを水300 mlに入れ、4 °C以下の冷蔵庫で8時間浸します。","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"米を浸す"},{"title":"米をかくはんする","content":"水を切った米と分量の牛乳250 mlをミキサーで2分かくはんし、細かくします。浸していた水は使いません。","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-02-20261103.webp","image_alt":"米をかくはんする"},{"title":"混合液をこす","content":"厚底の広い鍋に目の細かいざるを重ね、混合液を軽く押しながらこします。粗い残りは取り除きます。","image_alt":"混合液をこす","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"材料を混ぜる","content":"こした液体に残りの牛乳1750 mlと砂糖400 gを混ぜます。","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"材料を混ぜる"},{"title":"ゆっくり煮詰める","content":"ふたをせず、弱火で150〜180分静かに煮ます。鍋底と側面を休まず混ぜ、ベージュ色で濃厚な状態にします。","image_alt":"ゆっくり煮詰める","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"仕上がりを確かめる","content":"生地が鍋から離れ、へらの筋から鍋底が2〜3秒見えれば仕上がりの目安です。冷たい皿に小さじ1杯のせ、1分後も形を保つことを確認します。広がる場合は煮詰め続けます。","image_alt":"仕上がりを確かめる","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"器に分ける","content":"仕上がったら熱いうちに浅い耐熱容器に分けます。冷めるとさらに固くなります。","image_alt":"器に分ける","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"冷やす","content":"浅い容器で粗熱を取り、2時間以内に冷蔵します。4 °C以下の冷蔵庫で4時間冷やします。","image_alt":"冷やす","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"盛り付ける","content":"20人分のうち1人分を盛り付けます。そのままでも、12月の食卓でブニュエロやナティージャに添えても楽しめます。","image_alt":"盛り付ける","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/portada.webp"}]},{"id":"c1bcba10-de0d-4217-872d-aca5f4e8a692","expected_steps":[{"title":"Deixe o arroz de molho","content":"Deixe os 50 g de arroz nos 300 ml de água por 8 horas na geladeira a 4 °C ou menos."},{"title":"Bata o arroz","content":"Bata o arroz escorrido com 250 ml do leite por 2 minutos, até ficar bem fino. Descarte a água do molho."},{"title":"Coe a mistura","content":"Coe numa peneira fina sobre uma panela larga de fundo grosso, pressionando levemente para extrair o líquido; descarte o resíduo grosso.","image_alt":"Coe a mistura","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Misture os ingredientes","content":"Misture o líquido coado com os 1750 ml restantes de leite e os 400 g de açúcar na panela."},{"title":"Cozinhe lentamente","content":"Cozinhe destampado em fogo baixo por 150–180 minutos, com fervura suave, mexendo sem parar no fundo e nas laterais até engrossar e ficar bege.","image_alt":"Cozinhe lentamente","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Confira o ponto","content":"Está pronto quando desgruda da panela e a colher deixa o fundo visível por 2–3 segundos. Uma colher de chá num prato frio deve manter a forma após 1 minuto; se espalhar, continue cozinhando.","image_alt":"Confira o ponto","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Distribua o manjar","content":"Distribua o manjar quente em recipientes baixos resistentes ao calor assim que atingir o ponto. O doce firma mais ao esfriar.","image_alt":"Distribua o manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Esfrie o manjar","content":"Esfrie em recipientes rasos e leve à geladeira em até 2 horas. Deixe por 4 horas a 4 °C ou menos.","image_alt":"Esfrie o manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Sirva","content":"Sirva uma das 20 porções pura ou com buñuelos e natilla colombiana na mesa de dezembro.","image_alt":"Sirva","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/portada.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Deixe o arroz de molho","content":"Deixe os 50 g de arroz nos 300 ml de água por 8 horas na geladeira a 4 °C ou menos.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Deixe o arroz de molho"},{"title":"Bata o arroz","content":"Bata o arroz escorrido com 250 ml do leite por 2 minutos, até ficar bem fino. Descarte a água do molho.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-02-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Bata o arroz"},{"title":"Coe a mistura","content":"Coe numa peneira fina sobre uma panela larga de fundo grosso, pressionando levemente para extrair o líquido; descarte o resíduo grosso.","image_alt":"Coe a mistura","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Misture os ingredientes","content":"Misture o líquido coado com os 1750 ml restantes de leite e os 400 g de açúcar na panela.","image_url":"/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Misture os ingredientes"},{"title":"Cozinhe lentamente","content":"Cozinhe destampado em fogo baixo por 150–180 minutos, com fervura suave, mexendo sem parar no fundo e nas laterais até engrossar e ficar bege.","image_alt":"Cozinhe lentamente","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Confira o ponto","content":"Está pronto quando desgruda da panela e a colher deixa o fundo visível por 2–3 segundos. Uma colher de chá num prato frio deve manter a forma após 1 minuto; se espalhar, continue cozinhando.","image_alt":"Confira o ponto","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Distribua o manjar","content":"Distribua o manjar quente em recipientes baixos resistentes ao calor assim que atingir o ponto. O doce firma mais ao esfriar.","image_alt":"Distribua o manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Esfrie o manjar","content":"Esfrie em recipientes rasos e leve à geladeira em até 2 horas. Deixe por 4 horas a 4 °C ou menos.","image_alt":"Esfrie o manjar","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Sirva","content":"Sirva uma das 20 porções pura ou com buñuelos e natilla colombiana na mesa de dezembro.","image_alt":"Sirva","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/manjar-blanco-del-valle/portada.webp"}]},{"id":"d0c9ee1c-4f97-4c89-bee0-61896ad5048f","expected_steps":[{"title":"Ofen vorheizen","content":"Den Backofen auf 180 °C Ober- und Unterhitze vorheizen."},{"title":"Blech vorbereiten","content":"Ein flaches Backblech mit Backpapier belegen."},{"title":"Zwiebel garen","content":"Die Zwiebel im Öl bei mittlerer Hitze 5 Minuten weich garen.","image_alt":"Zwiebel garen","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Zwiebel abkühlen","content":"Die Zwiebel abkühlen lassen, bis sie nicht mehr heiß ist."},{"title":"Grundmasse mischen","content":"Semmelbrösel, Milch und Eier in einer großen Schüssel mischen.","image_alt":"Grundmasse mischen","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Fleisch zugeben","content":"Hackfleisch, Zwiebel, Salz und Pfeffer in die Schüssel geben.","image_alt":"Fleisch zugeben","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Vorsichtig mischen","content":"Nur kurz vermengen, ohne die Masse fest zu drücken.","image_alt":"Vorsichtig mischen","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Braten formen","content":"Auf dem vorbereiteten Blech ein etwa 25 × 10 cm großes Rechteck formen.","image_alt":"Braten formen","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Ketchup verstreichen","content":"Die Oberfläche mit Ketchup bestreichen.","image_alt":"Ketchup verstreichen","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-09.webp"},{"title":"Hackbraten backen","content":"Etwa 60 Minuten backen, bis die Mitte auf dem Thermometer 71 °C erreicht.","image_alt":"Hackbraten backen","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp"},{"title":"Ruhen lassen","content":"Den Braten außerhalb des Ofens 10 Minuten ruhen lassen."},{"title":"Portionen schneiden","content":"Den Braten in acht Scheiben schneiden."},{"title":"Servieren","content":"Die Scheiben warm servieren.","image_alt":"Servieren","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Ofen vorheizen","content":"Den Backofen auf 180 °C Ober- und Unterhitze vorheizen.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Ofen vorheizen"},{"title":"Blech vorbereiten","content":"Ein flaches Backblech mit Backpapier belegen.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-02-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Blech vorbereiten"},{"title":"Zwiebel garen","content":"Die Zwiebel im Öl bei mittlerer Hitze 5 Minuten weich garen.","image_alt":"Zwiebel garen","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Zwiebel abkühlen","content":"Die Zwiebel abkühlen lassen, bis sie nicht mehr heiß ist.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Zwiebel abkühlen"},{"title":"Grundmasse mischen","content":"Semmelbrösel, Milch und Eier in einer großen Schüssel mischen.","image_alt":"Grundmasse mischen","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Fleisch zugeben","content":"Hackfleisch, Zwiebel, Salz und Pfeffer in die Schüssel geben.","image_alt":"Fleisch zugeben","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Vorsichtig mischen","content":"Nur kurz vermengen, ohne die Masse fest zu drücken.","image_alt":"Vorsichtig mischen","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Braten formen","content":"Auf dem vorbereiteten Blech ein etwa 25 × 10 cm großes Rechteck formen.","image_alt":"Braten formen","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Ketchup verstreichen","content":"Die Oberfläche mit Ketchup bestreichen.","image_alt":"Ketchup verstreichen","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-09.webp"},{"title":"Hackbraten backen","content":"Etwa 60 Minuten backen, bis die Mitte auf dem Thermometer 71 °C erreicht.","image_alt":"Hackbraten backen","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp"},{"title":"Ruhen lassen","content":"Den Braten außerhalb des Ofens 10 Minuten ruhen lassen.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp","image_alt":"Ruhen lassen"},{"title":"Portionen schneiden","content":"Den Braten in acht Scheiben schneiden.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp","image_alt":"Portionen schneiden"},{"title":"Servieren","content":"Die Scheiben warm servieren.","image_alt":"Servieren","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp"}]},{"id":"571bf63b-6abb-4e0c-8b01-ac69f9a9d6cb","expected_steps":[{"title":"Preheat the oven","content":"Heat the oven to 180 °C (350 °F), conventional setting."},{"title":"Prepare the tray","content":"Line a flat baking tray with parchment."},{"title":"Cook the onion","content":"Cook the onion in the oil over medium heat for 5 minutes, until soft.","image_alt":"Cook the onion","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Cool the onion","content":"Let the onion cool until no longer hot."},{"title":"Mix the base","content":"Mix the breadcrumbs, milk and eggs in a large bowl.","image_alt":"Mix the base","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Add the beef","content":"Add the beef, onion, salt and pepper to the bowl.","image_alt":"Add the beef","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Combine gently","content":"Mix gently just until combined; do not compact the meat.","image_alt":"Combine gently","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Shape the loaf","content":"Shape into a rectangle about 25 × 10 cm on the prepared tray.","image_alt":"Shape the loaf","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Spread the ketchup","content":"Cover the top of the loaf with ketchup.","image_alt":"Spread the ketchup","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-09.webp"},{"title":"Bake the loaf","content":"Bake for about 60 minutes, until the centre reaches 71 °C (160 °F) on a thermometer.","image_alt":"Bake the loaf","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp"},{"title":"Let it rest","content":"Rest the loaf out of the oven for 10 minutes."},{"title":"Cut the portions","content":"Cut into eight slices."},{"title":"Serve","content":"Serve the slices warm.","image_alt":"Serve","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Preheat the oven","content":"Heat the oven to 180 °C (350 °F), conventional setting.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Preheat the oven"},{"title":"Prepare the tray","content":"Line a flat baking tray with parchment.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-02-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Prepare the tray"},{"title":"Cook the onion","content":"Cook the onion in the oil over medium heat for 5 minutes, until soft.","image_alt":"Cook the onion","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Cool the onion","content":"Let the onion cool until no longer hot.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Cool the onion"},{"title":"Mix the base","content":"Mix the breadcrumbs, milk and eggs in a large bowl.","image_alt":"Mix the base","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Add the beef","content":"Add the beef, onion, salt and pepper to the bowl.","image_alt":"Add the beef","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Combine gently","content":"Mix gently just until combined; do not compact the meat.","image_alt":"Combine gently","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Shape the loaf","content":"Shape into a rectangle about 25 × 10 cm on the prepared tray.","image_alt":"Shape the loaf","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Spread the ketchup","content":"Cover the top of the loaf with ketchup.","image_alt":"Spread the ketchup","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-09.webp"},{"title":"Bake the loaf","content":"Bake for about 60 minutes, until the centre reaches 71 °C (160 °F) on a thermometer.","image_alt":"Bake the loaf","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp"},{"title":"Let it rest","content":"Rest the loaf out of the oven for 10 minutes.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp","image_alt":"Let it rest"},{"title":"Cut the portions","content":"Cut into eight slices.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp","image_alt":"Cut the portions"},{"title":"Serve","content":"Serve the slices warm.","image_alt":"Serve","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp"}]},{"id":"c46cb1cc-3ff7-4437-96b9-0ea545ebb898","expected_steps":[{"title":"Precalienta el horno","content":"Calienta el horno a 180 °C con calor arriba y abajo."},{"title":"Prepara la bandeja","content":"Forra una bandeja plana con papel para horno."},{"title":"Sofríe la cebolla","content":"Cocina la cebolla con el aceite a fuego medio durante 5 minutos, hasta que esté tierna.","image_alt":"Sofríe la cebolla","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Enfría la cebolla","content":"Deja que la cebolla pierda el calor intenso."},{"title":"Mezcla la base","content":"Mezcla el pan rallado, la leche y los huevos en un bol grande.","image_alt":"Mezcla la base","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Añade la carne","content":"Incorpora la carne, la cebolla, la sal y la pimienta al bol.","image_alt":"Añade la carne","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Une los ingredientes","content":"Mezcla suavemente solo hasta integrar; evita compactar la carne.","image_alt":"Une los ingredientes","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Forma el pastel","content":"Forma un rectángulo de unos 25 × 10 cm sobre la bandeja preparada.","image_alt":"Forma el pastel","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Extiende el kétchup","content":"Cubre la superficie del pastel con el kétchup.","image_alt":"Extiende el kétchup","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-09.webp"},{"title":"Hornea el pastel","content":"Hornea unos 60 minutos, hasta que el centro alcance 71 °C medidos con termómetro.","image_alt":"Hornea el pastel","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp"},{"title":"Deja reposar","content":"Deja reposar el pastel 10 minutos fuera del horno."},{"title":"Corta las porciones","content":"Corta el pastel en ocho rebanadas."},{"title":"Sirve","content":"Sirve las rebanadas calientes.","image_alt":"Sirve","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Precalienta el horno","content":"Calienta el horno a 180 °C con calor arriba y abajo.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Precalienta el horno"},{"title":"Prepara la bandeja","content":"Forra una bandeja plana con papel para horno.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-02-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Prepara la bandeja"},{"title":"Sofríe la cebolla","content":"Cocina la cebolla con el aceite a fuego medio durante 5 minutos, hasta que esté tierna.","image_alt":"Sofríe la cebolla","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Enfría la cebolla","content":"Deja que la cebolla pierda el calor intenso.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Enfría la cebolla"},{"title":"Mezcla la base","content":"Mezcla el pan rallado, la leche y los huevos en un bol grande.","image_alt":"Mezcla la base","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Añade la carne","content":"Incorpora la carne, la cebolla, la sal y la pimienta al bol.","image_alt":"Añade la carne","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Une los ingredientes","content":"Mezcla suavemente solo hasta integrar; evita compactar la carne.","image_alt":"Une los ingredientes","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Forma el pastel","content":"Forma un rectángulo de unos 25 × 10 cm sobre la bandeja preparada.","image_alt":"Forma el pastel","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Extiende el kétchup","content":"Cubre la superficie del pastel con el kétchup.","image_alt":"Extiende el kétchup","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-09.webp"},{"title":"Hornea el pastel","content":"Hornea unos 60 minutos, hasta que el centro alcance 71 °C medidos con termómetro.","image_alt":"Hornea el pastel","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp"},{"title":"Deja reposar","content":"Deja reposar el pastel 10 minutos fuera del horno.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp","image_alt":"Deja reposar"},{"title":"Corta las porciones","content":"Corta el pastel en ocho rebanadas.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp","image_alt":"Corta las porciones"},{"title":"Sirve","content":"Sirve las rebanadas calientes.","image_alt":"Sirve","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp"}]},{"id":"8b65a569-49f5-4bb5-8efe-b0a67b28305e","expected_steps":[{"title":"Préchauffez le four","content":"Chauffez le four à 180 °C en chaleur traditionnelle."},{"title":"Préparez la plaque","content":"Tapissez une plaque plate de papier cuisson."},{"title":"Cuisez l’oignon","content":"Faites cuire l’oignon dans l’huile à feu moyen pendant 5 minutes, jusqu’à ce qu’il soit tendre.","image_alt":"Cuisez l’oignon","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Refroidissez l’oignon","content":"Laissez l’oignon perdre sa forte chaleur."},{"title":"Mélangez la base","content":"Mélangez la chapelure, le lait et les œufs dans un grand saladier.","image_alt":"Mélangez la base","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Ajoutez la viande","content":"Ajoutez le bœuf, l’oignon, le sel et le poivre dans le saladier.","image_alt":"Ajoutez la viande","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Mélangez doucement","content":"Mélangez juste assez pour incorporer les ingrédients sans tasser.","image_alt":"Mélangez doucement","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Façonnez le pain","content":"Formez un rectangle d’environ 25 × 10 cm sur la plaque préparée.","image_alt":"Façonnez le pain","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Étalez le ketchup","content":"Recouvrez le dessus de ketchup.","image_alt":"Étalez le ketchup","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-09.webp"},{"title":"Enfournez","content":"Faites cuire environ 60 minutes, jusqu’à 71 °C à cœur au thermomètre.","image_alt":"Enfournez","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp"},{"title":"Laissez reposer","content":"Laissez reposer hors du four pendant 10 minutes."},{"title":"Coupez les portions","content":"Coupez le pain de viande en huit tranches."},{"title":"Servez","content":"Servez les tranches chaudes.","image_alt":"Servez","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Préchauffez le four","content":"Chauffez le four à 180 °C en chaleur traditionnelle.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Préchauffez le four"},{"title":"Préparez la plaque","content":"Tapissez une plaque plate de papier cuisson.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-02-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Préparez la plaque"},{"title":"Cuisez l’oignon","content":"Faites cuire l’oignon dans l’huile à feu moyen pendant 5 minutes, jusqu’à ce qu’il soit tendre.","image_alt":"Cuisez l’oignon","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Refroidissez l’oignon","content":"Laissez l’oignon perdre sa forte chaleur.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Refroidissez l’oignon"},{"title":"Mélangez la base","content":"Mélangez la chapelure, le lait et les œufs dans un grand saladier.","image_alt":"Mélangez la base","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Ajoutez la viande","content":"Ajoutez le bœuf, l’oignon, le sel et le poivre dans le saladier.","image_alt":"Ajoutez la viande","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Mélangez doucement","content":"Mélangez juste assez pour incorporer les ingrédients sans tasser.","image_alt":"Mélangez doucement","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Façonnez le pain","content":"Formez un rectangle d’environ 25 × 10 cm sur la plaque préparée.","image_alt":"Façonnez le pain","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Étalez le ketchup","content":"Recouvrez le dessus de ketchup.","image_alt":"Étalez le ketchup","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-09.webp"},{"title":"Enfournez","content":"Faites cuire environ 60 minutes, jusqu’à 71 °C à cœur au thermomètre.","image_alt":"Enfournez","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp"},{"title":"Laissez reposer","content":"Laissez reposer hors du four pendant 10 minutes.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp","image_alt":"Laissez reposer"},{"title":"Coupez les portions","content":"Coupez le pain de viande en huit tranches.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp","image_alt":"Coupez les portions"},{"title":"Servez","content":"Servez les tranches chaudes.","image_alt":"Servez","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp"}]},{"id":"40330a9b-d1ee-4e37-b906-7f64d9e95e9c","expected_steps":[{"title":"Scalda il forno","content":"Porta il forno statico a 180 °C."},{"title":"Prepara la teglia","content":"Rivesti una teglia piana con carta forno."},{"title":"Cuoci la cipolla","content":"Cuoci la cipolla nell’olio a fuoco medio per 5 minuti, finché morbida.","image_alt":"Cuoci la cipolla","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Raffredda la cipolla","content":"Lascia intiepidire la cipolla."},{"title":"Mescola la base","content":"Mescola pangrattato, latte e uova in una ciotola grande.","image_alt":"Mescola la base","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi la carne","content":"Unisci manzo, cipolla, sale e pepe alla ciotola.","image_alt":"Aggiungi la carne","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Amalgama delicatamente","content":"Mescola solo fino a incorporare, senza pressare la carne.","image_alt":"Amalgama delicatamente","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Forma il polpettone","content":"Forma un rettangolo di circa 25 × 10 cm sulla teglia preparata.","image_alt":"Forma il polpettone","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Spalma il ketchup","content":"Copri la superficie con il ketchup.","image_alt":"Spalma il ketchup","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-09.webp"},{"title":"Cuoci in forno","content":"Cuoci per circa 60 minuti, fino a 71 °C al centro misurati con un termometro.","image_alt":"Cuoci in forno","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp"},{"title":"Lascia riposare","content":"Lascia riposare fuori dal forno per 10 minuti."},{"title":"Taglia le porzioni","content":"Taglia il polpettone in otto fette."},{"title":"Servi","content":"Servi le fette calde.","image_alt":"Servi","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Scalda il forno","content":"Porta il forno statico a 180 °C.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Scalda il forno"},{"title":"Prepara la teglia","content":"Rivesti una teglia piana con carta forno.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-02-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Prepara la teglia"},{"title":"Cuoci la cipolla","content":"Cuoci la cipolla nell’olio a fuoco medio per 5 minuti, finché morbida.","image_alt":"Cuoci la cipolla","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Raffredda la cipolla","content":"Lascia intiepidire la cipolla.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Raffredda la cipolla"},{"title":"Mescola la base","content":"Mescola pangrattato, latte e uova in una ciotola grande.","image_alt":"Mescola la base","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi la carne","content":"Unisci manzo, cipolla, sale e pepe alla ciotola.","image_alt":"Aggiungi la carne","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Amalgama delicatamente","content":"Mescola solo fino a incorporare, senza pressare la carne.","image_alt":"Amalgama delicatamente","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Forma il polpettone","content":"Forma un rettangolo di circa 25 × 10 cm sulla teglia preparata.","image_alt":"Forma il polpettone","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Spalma il ketchup","content":"Copri la superficie con il ketchup.","image_alt":"Spalma il ketchup","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-09.webp"},{"title":"Cuoci in forno","content":"Cuoci per circa 60 minuti, fino a 71 °C al centro misurati con un termometro.","image_alt":"Cuoci in forno","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp"},{"title":"Lascia riposare","content":"Lascia riposare fuori dal forno per 10 minuti.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp","image_alt":"Lascia riposare"},{"title":"Taglia le porzioni","content":"Taglia il polpettone in otto fette.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp","image_alt":"Taglia le porzioni"},{"title":"Servi","content":"Servi le fette calde.","image_alt":"Servi","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp"}]},{"id":"153637ce-db3d-4ef8-98b4-ca0c31c06c90","expected_steps":[{"title":"オーブンを予熱する","content":"オーブンを180 °Cに予熱します。"},{"title":"天板を用意する","content":"平らな天板にオーブンシートを敷きます。"},{"title":"玉ねぎを炒める","content":"玉ねぎを油で中火で5分、柔らかくなるまで炒めます。","image_alt":"玉ねぎを炒める","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"玉ねぎを冷ます","content":"玉ねぎの粗熱を取ります。"},{"title":"下地を混ぜる","content":"大きなボウルでパン粉、牛乳、卵を混ぜます。","image_alt":"下地を混ぜる","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"ひき肉を加える","content":"牛ひき肉、玉ねぎ、塩、こしょうをボウルに加えます。","image_alt":"ひき肉を加える","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"優しく混ぜる","content":"肉を押し固めず、全体がなじむまで軽く混ぜます。","image_alt":"優しく混ぜる","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"形を整える","content":"用意した天板の上で約25 × 10 cmの長方形に形を整えます。","image_alt":"形を整える","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"ケチャップを塗る","content":"表面にケチャップを塗ります。","image_alt":"ケチャップを塗る","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-09.webp"},{"title":"オーブンで焼く","content":"約60分焼き、中心温度が温度計で71 °Cに達するまで加熱します。","image_alt":"オーブンで焼く","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp"},{"title":"休ませる","content":"オーブンから出して10分休ませます。"},{"title":"切り分ける","content":"8枚に切り分けます。"},{"title":"盛り付ける","content":"温かいうちに盛り付けます。","image_alt":"盛り付ける","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"オーブンを予熱する","content":"オーブンを180 °Cに予熱します。","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"オーブンを予熱する"},{"title":"天板を用意する","content":"平らな天板にオーブンシートを敷きます。","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-02-20261103.webp","image_alt":"天板を用意する"},{"title":"玉ねぎを炒める","content":"玉ねぎを油で中火で5分、柔らかくなるまで炒めます。","image_alt":"玉ねぎを炒める","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"玉ねぎを冷ます","content":"玉ねぎの粗熱を取ります。","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"玉ねぎを冷ます"},{"title":"下地を混ぜる","content":"大きなボウルでパン粉、牛乳、卵を混ぜます。","image_alt":"下地を混ぜる","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"ひき肉を加える","content":"牛ひき肉、玉ねぎ、塩、こしょうをボウルに加えます。","image_alt":"ひき肉を加える","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"優しく混ぜる","content":"肉を押し固めず、全体がなじむまで軽く混ぜます。","image_alt":"優しく混ぜる","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"形を整える","content":"用意した天板の上で約25 × 10 cmの長方形に形を整えます。","image_alt":"形を整える","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"ケチャップを塗る","content":"表面にケチャップを塗ります。","image_alt":"ケチャップを塗る","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-09.webp"},{"title":"オーブンで焼く","content":"約60分焼き、中心温度が温度計で71 °Cに達するまで加熱します。","image_alt":"オーブンで焼く","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp"},{"title":"休ませる","content":"オーブンから出して10分休ませます。","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp","image_alt":"休ませる"},{"title":"切り分ける","content":"8枚に切り分けます。","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp","image_alt":"切り分ける"},{"title":"盛り付ける","content":"温かいうちに盛り付けます。","image_alt":"盛り付ける","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp"}]},{"id":"50f9920d-c5c9-4569-8a6b-e7906c735cc0","expected_steps":[{"title":"Aqueça o forno","content":"Aqueça o forno a 180 °C, com calor superior e inferior."},{"title":"Prepare a assadeira","content":"Forre uma assadeira plana com papel-manteiga."},{"title":"Refogue a cebola","content":"Cozinhe a cebola no azeite em fogo médio por 5 minutos, até ficar macia.","image_alt":"Refogue a cebola","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Esfrie a cebola","content":"Deixe a cebola perder o calor intenso."},{"title":"Misture a base","content":"Misture a farinha de rosca, o leite e os ovos numa tigela grande.","image_alt":"Misture a base","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Adicione a carne","content":"Junte carne, cebola, sal e pimenta à tigela.","image_alt":"Adicione a carne","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Misture delicadamente","content":"Misture apenas até integrar, sem compactar a carne.","image_alt":"Misture delicadamente","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Modele o bolo","content":"Modele um retângulo de cerca de 25 × 10 cm na assadeira preparada.","image_alt":"Modele o bolo","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Espalhe o ketchup","content":"Cubra a superfície do bolo com ketchup.","image_alt":"Espalhe o ketchup","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-09.webp"},{"title":"Asse o bolo","content":"Asse por cerca de 60 minutos, até o centro atingir 71 °C no termômetro.","image_alt":"Asse o bolo","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp"},{"title":"Deixe descansar","content":"Deixe descansar fora do forno por 10 minutos."},{"title":"Corte as porções","content":"Corte o bolo em oito fatias."},{"title":"Sirva","content":"Sirva as fatias quentes.","image_alt":"Sirva","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Aqueça o forno","content":"Aqueça o forno a 180 °C, com calor superior e inferior.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-01-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Aqueça o forno"},{"title":"Prepare a assadeira","content":"Forre uma assadeira plana com papel-manteiga.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-02-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Prepare a assadeira"},{"title":"Refogue a cebola","content":"Cozinhe a cebola no azeite em fogo médio por 5 minutos, até ficar macia.","image_alt":"Refogue a cebola","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Esfrie a cebola","content":"Deixe a cebola perder o calor intenso.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-completo-04-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Esfrie a cebola"},{"title":"Misture a base","content":"Misture a farinha de rosca, o leite e os ovos numa tigela grande.","image_alt":"Misture a base","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Adicione a carne","content":"Junte carne, cebola, sal e pimenta à tigela.","image_alt":"Adicione a carne","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-06.webp"},{"title":"Misture delicadamente","content":"Misture apenas até integrar, sem compactar a carne.","image_alt":"Misture delicadamente","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-07.webp"},{"title":"Modele o bolo","content":"Modele um retângulo de cerca de 25 × 10 cm na assadeira preparada.","image_alt":"Modele o bolo","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-08.webp"},{"title":"Espalhe o ketchup","content":"Cubra a superfície do bolo com ketchup.","image_alt":"Espalhe o ketchup","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-09.webp"},{"title":"Asse o bolo","content":"Asse por cerca de 60 minutos, até o centro atingir 71 °C no termômetro.","image_alt":"Asse o bolo","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp"},{"title":"Deixe descansar","content":"Deixe descansar fora do forno por 10 minutos.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/paso-10.webp","image_alt":"Deixe descansar"},{"title":"Corte as porções","content":"Corte o bolo em oito fatias.","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp","image_alt":"Corte as porções"},{"title":"Sirva","content":"Sirva as fatias quentes.","image_alt":"Sirva","image_url":"/recetas/pastel-de-carne-americano/portada.webp"}]},{"id":"4ae97065-6deb-47f2-9f74-1a8247dca81c","expected_steps":[{"title":"Teig zubereiten","content":"In einer Schüssel das vorgekochte Maismehl mit dem Salz vermischen. Nach und nach das lauwarme Wasser hinzufügen und mischen, bis ein glatter, formbarer Teig entsteht. Einige Minuten kneten, bis der Teig gut verbunden ist. 5 Minuten ruhen lassen.","image_alt":"Hand knetet Maismehlteig in einer Glasschüssel","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Scheiben formen","content":"Den Teig in Portionen der gewünschten Arepa-Größe teilen. Aus jeder Portion eine Kugel formen und zu etwa 1 cm dicken Scheiben flach drücken.","image_alt":"Hände formen Arepa-Teig zu Scheiben auf einem Holzbrett","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Pfanne erhitzen","content":"Eine große Pfanne bei mittlerer Hitze erhitzen und etwas Pflanzenöl oder Butter hinzugeben."},{"title":"Arepas braten","content":"Die Arepas in die Pfanne legen und pro Seite etwa 5 Minuten braten, bis sie außen goldbraun und knusprig sind. Die Pfanne kann abgedeckt werden, damit das Innere der Arepas mitgart.","image_alt":"Goldbraune Arepas braten in einer gusseisernen Pfanne","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Abkühlen lassen","content":"Nach dem Braten die Arepas aus der Pfanne nehmen und leicht abkühlen lassen."},{"title":"Arepas öffnen","content":"Um die gefüllten Arepas zusammenzustellen, jede Arepa halbieren, sodass eine Art Tasche entsteht.","image_alt":"Goldbraune Arepas halbiert, sodass eine Tasche entsteht","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Arepas füllen","content":"Jede Arepa mit zerpflücktem Fleisch, gebratenen Bohnen, geriebenem Käse, Avocadoscheiben, Hogao und knusprigem Speck nach Belieben füllen.","image_alt":"Arepa wird mit zerpflücktem Fleisch, Bohnen, Käse, Avocado und Hogao gefüllt","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Sauce hinzufügen","content":"Nach Geschmack Sauce hinzufügen, ob Ají, Tatarensauce, Guasacaca oder eine andere Sauce deiner Wahl."},{"title":"Schließen und servieren","content":"Die Arepas schließen und heiß servieren.","image_alt":"Eine frisch gefüllte Arepa con todo wird geschlossen, serviert mit einer Schale Ají-Sauce","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-06.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Teig zubereiten","content":"In einer Schüssel das vorgekochte Maismehl mit dem Salz vermischen. Nach und nach das lauwarme Wasser hinzufügen und mischen, bis ein glatter, formbarer Teig entsteht. Einige Minuten kneten, bis der Teig gut verbunden ist. 5 Minuten ruhen lassen.","image_alt":"Hand knetet Maismehlteig in einer Glasschüssel","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Scheiben formen","content":"Den Teig in Portionen der gewünschten Arepa-Größe teilen. Aus jeder Portion eine Kugel formen und zu etwa 1 cm dicken Scheiben flach drücken.","image_alt":"Hände formen Arepa-Teig zu Scheiben auf einem Holzbrett","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Pfanne erhitzen","content":"Eine große Pfanne bei mittlerer Hitze erhitzen und etwas Pflanzenöl oder Butter hinzugeben.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Pfanne erhitzen"},{"title":"Arepas braten","content":"Die Arepas in die Pfanne legen und pro Seite etwa 5 Minuten braten, bis sie außen goldbraun und knusprig sind. Die Pfanne kann abgedeckt werden, damit das Innere der Arepas mitgart.","image_alt":"Goldbraune Arepas braten in einer gusseisernen Pfanne","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Abkühlen lassen","content":"Nach dem Braten die Arepas aus der Pfanne nehmen und leicht abkühlen lassen.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Abkühlen lassen"},{"title":"Arepas öffnen","content":"Um die gefüllten Arepas zusammenzustellen, jede Arepa halbieren, sodass eine Art Tasche entsteht.","image_alt":"Goldbraune Arepas halbiert, sodass eine Tasche entsteht","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Arepas füllen","content":"Jede Arepa mit zerpflücktem Fleisch, gebratenen Bohnen, geriebenem Käse, Avocadoscheiben, Hogao und knusprigem Speck nach Belieben füllen.","image_alt":"Arepa wird mit zerpflücktem Fleisch, Bohnen, Käse, Avocado und Hogao gefüllt","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Sauce hinzufügen","content":"Nach Geschmack Sauce hinzufügen, ob Ají, Tatarensauce, Guasacaca oder eine andere Sauce deiner Wahl.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-completo-08-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Sauce hinzufügen"},{"title":"Schließen und servieren","content":"Die Arepas schließen und heiß servieren.","image_alt":"Eine frisch gefüllte Arepa con todo wird geschlossen, serviert mit einer Schale Ají-Sauce","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-06.webp"}]},{"id":"964fa3fa-05f2-4fe5-a78a-70804c9f0117","expected_steps":[{"title":"Prepare the dough","content":"In a bowl, mix the precooked corn flour with the salt. Gradually add the warm water and mix until you get a smooth, workable dough. Knead for a few minutes until well combined. Let it rest for 5 minutes.","image_alt":"Hand kneading corn flour dough in a glass bowl","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Shape the discs","content":"Divide the dough into portions of the size you want for the arepas. Form balls with each portion and flatten them into discs about 1 cm (0.4 in) thick.","image_alt":"Hands shaping arepa dough into discs on a wooden board","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Heat the pan","content":"Heat a large skillet over medium heat and add a little vegetable oil or butter."},{"title":"Cook the arepas","content":"Place the arepas in the skillet and cook for about 5 minutes per side, or until golden and crisp on the outside. You can cover the skillet to help cook the inside of the arepas.","image_alt":"Golden arepas cooking in a cast iron skillet","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Let them cool","content":"Once cooked, remove the arepas from the skillet and let them cool slightly."},{"title":"Open the arepas","content":"To assemble the loaded arepas, cut each one in half, creating a kind of pocket.","image_alt":"Golden arepas cut in half forming a pocket","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Fill the arepas","content":"Fill each arepa with shredded meat, refried beans, shredded cheese, avocado slices, hogao and crispy bacon, if using.","image_alt":"Arepa being filled with shredded meat, beans, cheese, avocado and hogao","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Add the sauce","content":"Add sauce to taste, whether ají, tartar, guasacaca or another sauce of your choice."},{"title":"Close and serve","content":"Close the arepas and serve them hot.","image_alt":"Closing a freshly filled loaded arepa, served with a bowl of ají sauce","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-06.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Prepare the dough","content":"In a bowl, mix the precooked corn flour with the salt. Gradually add the warm water and mix until you get a smooth, workable dough. Knead for a few minutes until well combined. Let it rest for 5 minutes.","image_alt":"Hand kneading corn flour dough in a glass bowl","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Shape the discs","content":"Divide the dough into portions of the size you want for the arepas. Form balls with each portion and flatten them into discs about 1 cm (0.4 in) thick.","image_alt":"Hands shaping arepa dough into discs on a wooden board","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Heat the pan","content":"Heat a large skillet over medium heat and add a little vegetable oil or butter.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Heat the pan"},{"title":"Cook the arepas","content":"Place the arepas in the skillet and cook for about 5 minutes per side, or until golden and crisp on the outside. You can cover the skillet to help cook the inside of the arepas.","image_alt":"Golden arepas cooking in a cast iron skillet","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Let them cool","content":"Once cooked, remove the arepas from the skillet and let them cool slightly.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Let them cool"},{"title":"Open the arepas","content":"To assemble the loaded arepas, cut each one in half, creating a kind of pocket.","image_alt":"Golden arepas cut in half forming a pocket","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Fill the arepas","content":"Fill each arepa with shredded meat, refried beans, shredded cheese, avocado slices, hogao and crispy bacon, if using.","image_alt":"Arepa being filled with shredded meat, beans, cheese, avocado and hogao","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Add the sauce","content":"Add sauce to taste, whether ají, tartar, guasacaca or another sauce of your choice.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-completo-08-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Add the sauce"},{"title":"Close and serve","content":"Close the arepas and serve them hot.","image_alt":"Closing a freshly filled loaded arepa, served with a bowl of ají sauce","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-06.webp"}]},{"id":"1f1ab8d4-0e85-4faa-ac4c-96f581cfbe90","expected_steps":[{"title":"Prepara la masa","content":"En un tazón, mezcla la harina de maíz precocida con la sal. Agrega poco a poco el agua tibia y mezcla hasta obtener una masa suave y manejable. Amasa durante unos minutos hasta que la masa esté bien integrada. Deja reposar durante 5 minutos.","image_alt":"Mano amasando la masa de harina de maíz en un tazón de vidrio","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Forma los discos","content":"Divide la masa en porciones del tamaño deseado para las arepas. Forma bolas con cada porción y aplánalas para crear discos de aproximadamente 1 cm de grosor.","image_alt":"Manos formando discos de masa de arepa sobre una tabla de madera","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Calienta la sartén","content":"Calienta una sartén grande a fuego medio y agrega un poco de aceite vegetal o mantequilla."},{"title":"Cocina las arepas","content":"Coloca las arepas en la sartén y cocina durante aproximadamente 5 minutos por cada lado, o hasta que estén doradas y crujientes por fuera. Puedes tapar la sartén para ayudar a cocinar el interior de las arepas.","image_alt":"Arepas doradas cocinándose en una sartén de hierro fundido","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Deja enfriar","content":"Una vez cocidas, retira las arepas de la sartén y déjalas enfriar ligeramente."},{"title":"Abre las arepas","content":"Para armar las arepas con todo, corta cada arepa por la mitad, creando una especie de bolsillo.","image_alt":"Arepas doradas cortadas por la mitad formando un bolsillo","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Rellena las arepas","content":"Rellena cada arepa con carne desmechada, frijoles refritos, queso rallado, aguacate en rodajas, hogao y tocineta o bacon crujiente si lo deseas.","image_alt":"Arepa siendo rellenada con carne desmechada, frijoles, queso, aguacate y hogao","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Añade la salsa","content":"Añade salsa al gusto, ya sea ají, tártara, guasacaca u otra salsa de tu elección."},{"title":"Cierra y sirve","content":"Cierra las arepas y sírvelas calientes.","image_alt":"Cerrando una arepa con todo recién rellena, servida junto a una salsa de ají","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-06.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Prepara la masa","content":"En un tazón, mezcla la harina de maíz precocida con la sal. Agrega poco a poco el agua tibia y mezcla hasta obtener una masa suave y manejable. Amasa durante unos minutos hasta que la masa esté bien integrada. Deja reposar durante 5 minutos.","image_alt":"Mano amasando la masa de harina de maíz en un tazón de vidrio","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Forma los discos","content":"Divide la masa en porciones del tamaño deseado para las arepas. Forma bolas con cada porción y aplánalas para crear discos de aproximadamente 1 cm de grosor.","image_alt":"Manos formando discos de masa de arepa sobre una tabla de madera","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Calienta la sartén","content":"Calienta una sartén grande a fuego medio y agrega un poco de aceite vegetal o mantequilla.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Calienta la sartén"},{"title":"Cocina las arepas","content":"Coloca las arepas en la sartén y cocina durante aproximadamente 5 minutos por cada lado, o hasta que estén doradas y crujientes por fuera. Puedes tapar la sartén para ayudar a cocinar el interior de las arepas.","image_alt":"Arepas doradas cocinándose en una sartén de hierro fundido","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Deja enfriar","content":"Una vez cocidas, retira las arepas de la sartén y déjalas enfriar ligeramente.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Deja enfriar"},{"title":"Abre las arepas","content":"Para armar las arepas con todo, corta cada arepa por la mitad, creando una especie de bolsillo.","image_alt":"Arepas doradas cortadas por la mitad formando un bolsillo","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Rellena las arepas","content":"Rellena cada arepa con carne desmechada, frijoles refritos, queso rallado, aguacate en rodajas, hogao y tocineta o bacon crujiente si lo deseas.","image_alt":"Arepa siendo rellenada con carne desmechada, frijoles, queso, aguacate y hogao","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Añade la salsa","content":"Añade salsa al gusto, ya sea ají, tártara, guasacaca u otra salsa de tu elección.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-completo-08-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Añade la salsa"},{"title":"Cierra y sirve","content":"Cierra las arepas y sírvelas calientes.","image_alt":"Cerrando una arepa con todo recién rellena, servida junto a una salsa de ají","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-06.webp"}]},{"id":"ac3e89c9-a5be-4495-8cc5-73bb8a1fcc5b","expected_steps":[{"title":"Préparez la pâte","content":"Dans un bol, mélangez la farine de maïs précuite avec le sel. Ajoutez peu à peu l'eau tiède et mélangez jusqu'à obtenir une pâte lisse et maniable. Pétrissez pendant quelques minutes jusqu'à ce que la pâte soit bien homogène. Laissez reposer 5 minutes.","image_alt":"Main pétrissant la pâte de farine de maïs dans un bol en verre","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Formez les disques","content":"Divisez la pâte en portions de la taille souhaitée pour les arepas. Formez des boules avec chaque portion et aplatissez-les pour créer des disques d'environ 1 cm d'épaisseur.","image_alt":"Mains formant des disques de pâte à arepa sur une planche en bois","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Chauffez la poêle","content":"Faites chauffer une grande poêle à feu moyen et ajoutez un peu d'huile végétale ou de beurre."},{"title":"Cuisez les arepas","content":"Placez les arepas dans la poêle et faites cuire environ 5 minutes de chaque côté, jusqu'à ce qu'elles soient dorées et croustillantes à l'extérieur. Vous pouvez couvrir la poêle pour aider à cuire l'intérieur des arepas.","image_alt":"Arepas dorées cuisant dans une poêle en fonte","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Laissez refroidir","content":"Une fois cuites, retirez les arepas de la poêle et laissez-les tiédir légèrement."},{"title":"Ouvrez les arepas","content":"Pour assembler les arepas garnies, coupez chaque arepa en deux, en formant une sorte de poche.","image_alt":"Arepas dorées coupées en deux formant une poche","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Garnissez les arepas","content":"Garnissez chaque arepa avec de la viande effilochée, des haricots frits, du fromage râpé, des tranches d'avocat, du hogao et du bacon croustillant si vous le souhaitez.","image_alt":"Arepa garnie de viande effilochée, haricots, fromage, avocat et hogao","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Ajoutez la sauce","content":"Ajoutez de la sauce selon votre goût, que ce soit de l'ají, de la sauce tartare, de la guasacaca ou une autre sauce de votre choix."},{"title":"Fermez et servez","content":"Fermez les arepas et servez-les chaudes.","image_alt":"Fermeture d'une arepa garnie fraîchement remplie, servie avec un bol de sauce ají","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-06.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Préparez la pâte","content":"Dans un bol, mélangez la farine de maïs précuite avec le sel. Ajoutez peu à peu l'eau tiède et mélangez jusqu'à obtenir une pâte lisse et maniable. Pétrissez pendant quelques minutes jusqu'à ce que la pâte soit bien homogène. Laissez reposer 5 minutes.","image_alt":"Main pétrissant la pâte de farine de maïs dans un bol en verre","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Formez les disques","content":"Divisez la pâte en portions de la taille souhaitée pour les arepas. Formez des boules avec chaque portion et aplatissez-les pour créer des disques d'environ 1 cm d'épaisseur.","image_alt":"Mains formant des disques de pâte à arepa sur une planche en bois","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Chauffez la poêle","content":"Faites chauffer une grande poêle à feu moyen et ajoutez un peu d'huile végétale ou de beurre.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Chauffez la poêle"},{"title":"Cuisez les arepas","content":"Placez les arepas dans la poêle et faites cuire environ 5 minutes de chaque côté, jusqu'à ce qu'elles soient dorées et croustillantes à l'extérieur. Vous pouvez couvrir la poêle pour aider à cuire l'intérieur des arepas.","image_alt":"Arepas dorées cuisant dans une poêle en fonte","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Laissez refroidir","content":"Une fois cuites, retirez les arepas de la poêle et laissez-les tiédir légèrement.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Laissez refroidir"},{"title":"Ouvrez les arepas","content":"Pour assembler les arepas garnies, coupez chaque arepa en deux, en formant une sorte de poche.","image_alt":"Arepas dorées coupées en deux formant une poche","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Garnissez les arepas","content":"Garnissez chaque arepa avec de la viande effilochée, des haricots frits, du fromage râpé, des tranches d'avocat, du hogao et du bacon croustillant si vous le souhaitez.","image_alt":"Arepa garnie de viande effilochée, haricots, fromage, avocat et hogao","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Ajoutez la sauce","content":"Ajoutez de la sauce selon votre goût, que ce soit de l'ají, de la sauce tartare, de la guasacaca ou une autre sauce de votre choix.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-completo-08-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Ajoutez la sauce"},{"title":"Fermez et servez","content":"Fermez les arepas et servez-les chaudes.","image_alt":"Fermeture d'une arepa garnie fraîchement remplie, servie avec un bol de sauce ají","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-06.webp"}]},{"id":"da647e2a-a664-4cfb-a2c0-91c942a319bb","expected_steps":[{"title":"Prepara l'impasto","content":"In una ciotola, mescola la farina di mais precotta con il sale. Aggiungi poco a poco l'acqua tiepida e mescola fino a ottenere un impasto liscio e lavorabile. Lavora l'impasto per qualche minuto finché non è ben amalgamato. Lascia riposare per 5 minuti.","image_alt":"Mano che impasta la farina di mais in una ciotola di vetro","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Forma i dischi","content":"Dividi l'impasto in porzioni della dimensione desiderata per le arepas. Forma delle palline con ogni porzione e appiattiscile per creare dischi di circa 1 cm di spessore.","image_alt":"Mani che formano dischi di impasto per arepa su un tagliere di legno","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Scalda la padella","content":"Scalda una padella grande a fuoco medio e aggiungi un po' di olio vegetale o burro."},{"title":"Cuoci le arepas","content":"Metti le arepas in padella e cuoci per circa 5 minuti per lato, finché non sono dorate e croccanti all'esterno. Puoi coprire la padella per aiutare a cuocere l'interno delle arepas.","image_alt":"Arepas dorate che cuociono in una padella di ghisa","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Lascia raffreddare","content":"Una volta cotte, togli le arepas dalla padella e lasciale raffreddare leggermente."},{"title":"Apri le arepas","content":"Per assemblare le arepas farcite, taglia ogni arepa a metà, creando una sorta di tasca.","image_alt":"Arepas dorate tagliate a metà a formare una tasca","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Farcisci le arepas","content":"Farcisci ogni arepa con carne sfilacciata, fagioli fritti, formaggio grattugiato, fette di avocado, hogao e pancetta croccante, se gradita.","image_alt":"Arepa farcita con carne sfilacciata, fagioli, formaggio, avocado e hogao","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi la salsa","content":"Aggiungi la salsa a piacere, che sia ají, salsa tartara, guasacaca o un'altra salsa a tua scelta."},{"title":"Chiudi e servi","content":"Chiudi le arepas e servile calde.","image_alt":"Chiusura di un'arepa farcita appena riempita, servita con una ciotola di salsa ají","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-06.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Prepara l'impasto","content":"In una ciotola, mescola la farina di mais precotta con il sale. Aggiungi poco a poco l'acqua tiepida e mescola fino a ottenere un impasto liscio e lavorabile. Lavora l'impasto per qualche minuto finché non è ben amalgamato. Lascia riposare per 5 minuti.","image_alt":"Mano che impasta la farina di mais in una ciotola di vetro","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Forma i dischi","content":"Dividi l'impasto in porzioni della dimensione desiderata per le arepas. Forma delle palline con ogni porzione e appiattiscile per creare dischi di circa 1 cm di spessore.","image_alt":"Mani che formano dischi di impasto per arepa su un tagliere di legno","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Scalda la padella","content":"Scalda una padella grande a fuoco medio e aggiungi un po' di olio vegetale o burro.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Scalda la padella"},{"title":"Cuoci le arepas","content":"Metti le arepas in padella e cuoci per circa 5 minuti per lato, finché non sono dorate e croccanti all'esterno. Puoi coprire la padella per aiutare a cuocere l'interno delle arepas.","image_alt":"Arepas dorate che cuociono in una padella di ghisa","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Lascia raffreddare","content":"Una volta cotte, togli le arepas dalla padella e lasciale raffreddare leggermente.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Lascia raffreddare"},{"title":"Apri le arepas","content":"Per assemblare le arepas farcite, taglia ogni arepa a metà, creando una sorta di tasca.","image_alt":"Arepas dorate tagliate a metà a formare una tasca","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Farcisci le arepas","content":"Farcisci ogni arepa con carne sfilacciata, fagioli fritti, formaggio grattugiato, fette di avocado, hogao e pancetta croccante, se gradita.","image_alt":"Arepa farcita con carne sfilacciata, fagioli, formaggio, avocado e hogao","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Aggiungi la salsa","content":"Aggiungi la salsa a piacere, che sia ají, salsa tartara, guasacaca o un'altra salsa a tua scelta.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-completo-08-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Aggiungi la salsa"},{"title":"Chiudi e servi","content":"Chiudi le arepas e servile calde.","image_alt":"Chiusura di un'arepa farcita appena riempita, servita con una ciotola di salsa ají","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-06.webp"}]},{"id":"688e4d13-c7bf-4441-8b15-990c132a7e4a","expected_steps":[{"title":"生地を作る","content":"ボウルにプレクックコーンフラワーと塩を入れて混ぜる。ぬるま湯を少しずつ加えながら、なめらかで扱いやすい生地になるまで混ぜる。数分こねてよくまとまったら、5分休ませる。","image_alt":"ガラスボウルでとうもろこし粉の生地をこねる手","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"円盤状に成形する","content":"生地を好みのアレパの大きさに分ける。それぞれを丸めてから、厚さ約1cmの円盤状に平らにする。","image_alt":"木製のまな板の上でアレパ生地を円盤状に成形する手","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"フライパンを熱する","content":"大きめのフライパンを中火で熱し、植物油またはバターを少量加える。"},{"title":"アレパを焼く","content":"フライパンにアレパを並べ、両面をそれぞれ約5分ずつ、外側が香ばしくきつね色になるまで焼く。フライパンに蓋をすると内部まで火が通りやすくなる。","image_alt":"鋳鉄のフライパンで焼き色がついていくアレパ","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"少し冷ます","content":"焼き上がったらアレパをフライパンから取り出し、少し冷ます。"},{"title":"アレパを開く","content":"具だくさんアレパに仕上げるため、それぞれのアレパを半分に切り、ポケット状にする。","image_alt":"半分に切ってポケット状になったきつね色のアレパ","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"アレパに具を詰める","content":"ほぐし肉、リフライドビーンズ、すりおろしチーズ、アボカドの薄切り、オガオ、お好みでカリカリベーコンをそれぞれのアレパに詰める。","image_alt":"ほぐし肉、豆、チーズ、アボカド、オガオを詰めているアレパ","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"ソースを加える","content":"アヒ、タルタル、グアサカカなど、お好みのソースを加える。"},{"title":"閉じて盛り付ける","content":"アレパを閉じて熱いうちに盛り付ける。","image_alt":"具を詰めたばかりのアレパを閉じ、アヒソースを添えて提供する様子","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-06.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"生地を作る","content":"ボウルにプレクックコーンフラワーと塩を入れて混ぜる。ぬるま湯を少しずつ加えながら、なめらかで扱いやすい生地になるまで混ぜる。数分こねてよくまとまったら、5分休ませる。","image_alt":"ガラスボウルでとうもろこし粉の生地をこねる手","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"円盤状に成形する","content":"生地を好みのアレパの大きさに分ける。それぞれを丸めてから、厚さ約1cmの円盤状に平らにする。","image_alt":"木製のまな板の上でアレパ生地を円盤状に成形する手","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"フライパンを熱する","content":"大きめのフライパンを中火で熱し、植物油またはバターを少量加える。","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"フライパンを熱する"},{"title":"アレパを焼く","content":"フライパンにアレパを並べ、両面をそれぞれ約5分ずつ、外側が香ばしくきつね色になるまで焼く。フライパンに蓋をすると内部まで火が通りやすくなる。","image_alt":"鋳鉄のフライパンで焼き色がついていくアレパ","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"少し冷ます","content":"焼き上がったらアレパをフライパンから取り出し、少し冷ます。","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"少し冷ます"},{"title":"アレパを開く","content":"具だくさんアレパに仕上げるため、それぞれのアレパを半分に切り、ポケット状にする。","image_alt":"半分に切ってポケット状になったきつね色のアレパ","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"アレパに具を詰める","content":"ほぐし肉、リフライドビーンズ、すりおろしチーズ、アボカドの薄切り、オガオ、お好みでカリカリベーコンをそれぞれのアレパに詰める。","image_alt":"ほぐし肉、豆、チーズ、アボカド、オガオを詰めているアレパ","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"ソースを加える","content":"アヒ、タルタル、グアサカカなど、お好みのソースを加える。","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-completo-08-20261103.webp","image_alt":"ソースを加える"},{"title":"閉じて盛り付ける","content":"アレパを閉じて熱いうちに盛り付ける。","image_alt":"具を詰めたばかりのアレパを閉じ、アヒソースを添えて提供する様子","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-06.webp"}]},{"id":"4d37eeb6-e8b8-4705-835a-a62952868227","expected_steps":[{"title":"Prepare a massa","content":"Em uma tigela, misture a farinha de milho pré-cozida com o sal. Adicione aos poucos a água morna e misture até obter uma massa lisa e maleável. Sove por alguns minutos até que a massa esteja bem homogênea. Deixe descansar por 5 minutos.","image_alt":"Mão sovando a massa de farinha de milho em uma tigela de vidro","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Molde os discos","content":"Divida a massa em porções do tamanho desejado para as arepas. Faça bolinhas com cada porção e achate-as para formar discos de cerca de 1 cm de espessura.","image_alt":"Mãos moldando discos de massa de arepa sobre uma tábua de madeira","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Aqueça a frigideira","content":"Aqueça uma frigideira grande em fogo médio e adicione um pouco de óleo vegetal ou manteiga."},{"title":"Cozinhe as arepas","content":"Coloque as arepas na frigideira e cozinhe por cerca de 5 minutos de cada lado, ou até ficarem douradas e crocantes por fora. Você pode tampar a frigideira para ajudar a cozinhar o interior das arepas.","image_alt":"Arepas douradas cozinhando em uma frigideira de ferro fundido","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Deixe esfriar","content":"Depois de cozidas, retire as arepas da frigideira e deixe esfriar levemente."},{"title":"Abra as arepas","content":"Para montar as arepas recheadas, corte cada arepa ao meio, criando uma espécie de bolso.","image_alt":"Arepas douradas cortadas ao meio formando um bolso","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Recheie as arepas","content":"Recheie cada arepa com carne desfiada, feijão refrito, queijo ralado, fatias de abacate, hogao e bacon crocante, se desejar.","image_alt":"Arepa sendo recheada com carne desfiada, feijão, queijo, abacate e hogao","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Adicione o molho","content":"Adicione molho a gosto, seja ají, tártaro, guasacaca ou outro molho de sua escolha."},{"title":"Feche e sirva","content":"Feche as arepas e sirva-as quentes.","image_alt":"Fechando uma arepa recheada recém-preparada, servida com uma tigela de molho ají","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-06.webp"}],"new_steps":[{"title":"Prepare a massa","content":"Em uma tigela, misture a farinha de milho pré-cozida com o sal. Adicione aos poucos a água morna e misture até obter uma massa lisa e maleável. Sove por alguns minutos até que a massa esteja bem homogênea. Deixe descansar por 5 minutos.","image_alt":"Mão sovando a massa de farinha de milho em uma tigela de vidro","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-01.webp"},{"title":"Molde os discos","content":"Divida a massa em porções do tamanho desejado para as arepas. Faça bolinhas com cada porção e achate-as para formar discos de cerca de 1 cm de espessura.","image_alt":"Mãos moldando discos de massa de arepa sobre uma tábua de madeira","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-02.webp"},{"title":"Aqueça a frigideira","content":"Aqueça uma frigideira grande em fogo médio e adicione um pouco de óleo vegetal ou manteiga.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-completo-03-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Aqueça a frigideira"},{"title":"Cozinhe as arepas","content":"Coloque as arepas na frigideira e cozinhe por cerca de 5 minutos de cada lado, ou até ficarem douradas e crocantes por fora. Você pode tampar a frigideira para ajudar a cozinhar o interior das arepas.","image_alt":"Arepas douradas cozinhando em uma frigideira de ferro fundido","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp"},{"title":"Deixe esfriar","content":"Depois de cozidas, retire as arepas da frigideira e deixe esfriar levemente.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Deixe esfriar"},{"title":"Abra as arepas","content":"Para montar as arepas recheadas, corte cada arepa ao meio, criando uma espécie de bolso.","image_alt":"Arepas douradas cortadas ao meio formando um bolso","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-04.webp"},{"title":"Recheie as arepas","content":"Recheie cada arepa com carne desfiada, feijão refrito, queijo ralado, fatias de abacate, hogao e bacon crocante, se desejar.","image_alt":"Arepa sendo recheada com carne desfiada, feijão, queijo, abacate e hogao","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-05.webp"},{"title":"Adicione o molho","content":"Adicione molho a gosto, seja ají, tártaro, guasacaca ou outro molho de sua escolha.","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-completo-08-20261103.webp","image_alt":"Adicione o molho"},{"title":"Feche e sirva","content":"Feche as arepas e sirva-as quentes.","image_alt":"Fechando uma arepa recheada recém-preparada, servida com uma tigela de molho ají","image_url":"/recetas/arepa-con-todo/paso-06.webp"}]}]$imagepatch$::jsonb) as x(id uuid, expected_steps jsonb,new_steps jsonb)), changed as (update public.recipes r set steps=p.new_steps,updated_at=now() from patches p where r.id=p.id and r.steps=p.expected_steps returning r.id,r.language) select language,count(*) as updated_versions from changed group by language;
